<li data-start=3D"4398" data-end=3D"4462">
<p data-start=3D"4400" data-end=3D"4462">Une philosophie orient=C3=A9e <str=
ong data-start=3D"4425" data-end=3D"4461">accessibilit=C3=A9 et qualit=C3=
=A9 de code</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4464" data-end=3D"4467">
<h2 data-start=3D"4469" data-end=3D"4507">=F0=9F=94=84 6. Convention over c=
onfiguration</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4509" data-end=3D"4636">Django vous <strong data-start=3D"=
4521" data-end=3D"4530">guide</strong>. Pas besoin de passer 1h =C3=A0 conf=
igurer un routeur ou l=E2=80=99authentification : tout est pr=C3=A9vu. Cela=
 permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4724">
<li data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4655">
<p data-start=3D"4639" data-end=3D"4655">coder plus vite,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4656" data-end=3D"4689">
<p data-start=3D"4658" data-end=3D"4689">respecter les bonnes pratiques,</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4690" data-end=3D"4724">
<p data-start=3D"4692" data-end=3D"4724">=C3=A9viter les pi=C3=A8ges des d=
=C3=A9butants.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4726" data-end=3D"4729">
<h2 data-start=3D"4731" data-end=3D"4767">=F0=9F=8C=8D 7. Internationalisat=
ion (i18n)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4769" data-end=3D"4895">Django permet de traduire facileme=
nt une app en <strong data-start=3D"4817" data-end=3D"4838">plusieurs langu=
es</strong>, g=C3=A9rer les <strong data-start=3D"4850" data-end=3D"4868">z=
ones horaires</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"4870" data-end=3D"4889">forma=
ts de date</strong>, etc.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4897" data-end=3D"4900">
<h2 data-start=3D"4902" data-end=3D"4923">=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8F 8. Testabil=
it=C3=A9</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4925" data-end=3D"4978">Django int=C3=A8gre une couche de =
test unitaire compl=C3=A8te :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4979" data-end=3D"5070">
<li data-start=3D"4979" data-end=3D"5004">
<p data-start=3D"4981" data-end=3D"5004">Simulation de requ=C3=AAtes,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5005" data-end=3D"5026">
<p data-start=3D"5007" data-end=3D"5026">Test du rendu HTML,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5027" data-end=3D"5070">
<p data-start=3D"5029" data-end=3D"5070">Test des mod=C3=A8les, formulaires=
, vues, API.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5072" data-end=3D"5075">
<h2 data-start=3D"5077" data-end=3D"5124">=F0=9F=A7=91=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=92=BB=
 9. Compatible avec les outils modernes</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5126" data-end=3D"5274">
<li data-start=3D"5126" data-end=3D"5157">
<p data-start=3D"5128" data-end=3D"5157">Compatible ASGI (WebSockets),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5158" data-end=3D"5192">
<p data-start=3D"5160" data-end=3D"5192">Compatible Docker et Kubernetes,</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5193" data-end=3D"5243">
<p data-start=3D"5195" data-end=3D"5243">S=E2=80=99int=C3=A8gre avec Redis,=
 PostgreSQL, Elasticsearch,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5244" data-end=3D"5274">
<p data-start=3D"5246" data-end=3D"5274">Supporte les CI/CD modernes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5276" data-end=3D"5279">
<h1 data-start=3D"5281" data-end=3D"5328">=F0=9F=8F=9B=EF=B8=8F 1.3 =E2=80=
=93 Historique et philosophie de Django</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"5330" data-end=3D"5343">=F0=9F=93=85 Origine</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5344" data-end=3D"5505">Django a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 cr=C3=A9=C3=
=A9 en 2003 par <strong data-start=3D"5374" data-end=3D"5393">Adrian Holova=
ty</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"5397" data-end=3D"5415">Simon Willison=
</strong>, deux d=C3=A9veloppeurs travaillant pour le journal <em data-star=
t=3D"5463" data-end=3D"5487">Lawrence Journal-World</em>, au Kansas (USA).<=
/p>
<hr data-start=3D"5507" data-end=3D"5510">
<h2 data-start=3D"5512" data-end=3D"5534">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectif initial</h2=
>
<p data-start=3D"5536" data-end=3D"5557">Le but =C3=A9tait simple :</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"5558" data-end=3D"5642">
<p data-start=3D"5560" data-end=3D"5642"><strong data-start=3D"5560" data-e=
nd=3D"5642">=E2=80=9CCr=C3=A9er rapidement des sites complexes et performan=
ts pour des r=C3=A9dactions web.=E2=80=9D</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"5644" data-end=3D"5799">L=E2=80=99enjeu : permettre aux jo=
urnalistes d=E2=80=99avoir des outils puissants pour publier du contenu <st=
rong data-start=3D"5734" data-end=3D"5798">sans que les d=C3=A9veloppeurs a=
ient =C3=A0 tout recoder =C3=A0 chaque fois</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5801" data-end=3D"5804">
<h2 data-start=3D"5806" data-end=3D"5832">=F0=9F=93=A6 Naissance officielle=
</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5833" data-end=3D"6065">En <strong data-start=3D"5836" dat=
a-end=3D"5852">juillet 2005</strong>, Django devient un <strong data-start=
=3D"5872" data-end=3D"5894">projet open source</strong> sous licence BSD. I=
l attire rapidement une communaut=C3=A9 de d=C3=A9veloppeurs Python, car =
=C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9poque, il n=E2=80=99y avait pas beaucoup de framewor=
ks aussi puissants dans cet =C3=A9cosyst=C3=A8me.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6067" data-end=3D"6070">
<h2 data-start=3D"6072" data-end=3D"6099">=F0=9F=A7=AD La philosophie Djang=
o</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6101" data-end=3D"6149">Django suit plusieurs <strong data=
-start=3D"6123" data-end=3D"6147">principes fondateurs</strong> :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6151" data-end=3D"6191">1. <strong data-start=3D"6158" da=
ta-end=3D"6165">DRY</strong> =E2=80=93 <em data-start=3D"6168" data-end=3D"=
6191">Don=E2=80=99t Repeat Yourself</em></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6192" data-end=3D"6276">
<p data-start=3D"6194" data-end=3D"6276">=C3=89vitez la duplication de code=
. Le framework pousse =C3=A0 factoriser les comportements.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6278" data-end=3D"6281">
<h3 data-start=3D"6283" data-end=3D"6311">2. <strong data-start=3D"6290" da=
ta-end=3D"6311">Rapid Development</strong></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6312" data-end=3D"6400">
<p data-start=3D"6314" data-end=3D"6400">Acc=C3=A9l=C3=A9rez la cr=C3=A9ati=
on d=E2=80=99applications web, surtout dans les premi=C3=A8res phases du pr=
ojet.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6402" data-end=3D"6405">
<h3 data-start=3D"6407" data-end=3D"6450">3. <strong data-start=3D"6414" da=
ta-end=3D"6450">Explicit is better than implicit</strong></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6451" data-end=3D"6555">
<p data-start=3D"6453" data-end=3D"6555">Tout doit =C3=AAtre clair. Par exe=
mple, la configuration d=E2=80=99une vue est explicite dans le fichier <cod=
e data-start=3D"6545" data-end=3D"6554">urls.py</code>.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6557" data-end=3D"6560">
<h3 data-start=3D"6562" data-end=3D"6587">4. <strong data-start=3D"6569" da=
ta-end=3D"6587">Security first</strong></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6588" data-end=3D"6692">
<p data-start=3D"6590" data-end=3D"6692">Beaucoup de frameworks mettent la =
s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 en option. Django la met <strong data-start=3D"6658" dat=
a-end=3D"6669">au c=C5=93ur</strong> de son fonctionnement.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6694" data-end=3D"6697">
<h3 data-start=3D"6699" data-end=3D"6728">5. <strong data-start=3D"6706" da=
ta-end=3D"6728">Batteries Included</strong></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6855">
<p data-start=3D"6731" data-end=3D"6855">Tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour=
 construire une application compl=C3=A8te est fourni : ORM, admin, auth, ge=
stion statique, etc.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6857" data-end=3D"6860">
<h2 data-start=3D"6862" data-end=3D"6886">=F0=9F=94=84 Django aujourd=E2=80=
=99hui</h2>
