<li data-start=3D"6888" data-end=3D"6943">
<p data-start=3D"6890" data-end=3D"6943">Maintenu par la <strong data-start=
=3D"6906" data-end=3D"6942">Django Software Foundation (DSF)</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6944" data-end=3D"6995">
