<h2 data-start=3D"1056" data-end=3D"1096">=F0=9F=94=A7 1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce=
 qu=E2=80=99un projet Django ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1098" data-end=3D"1168">Un <strong data-start=3D"1101" dat=
a-end=3D"1118">projet Django</strong> est une <strong data-start=3D"1127" d=
ata-end=3D"1155">application web compl=C3=A8te</strong> regroupant :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1170" data-end=3D"1409">
<li data-start=3D"1170" data-end=3D"1220">
<p data-start=3D"1172" data-end=3D"1220"><strong data-start=3D"1172" data-e=
nd=3D"1196">des r=C3=A9glages globaux</strong> (fichier <code data-start=3D=
"1206" data-end=3D"1219">settings.py</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1221" data-end=3D"1265">
<p data-start=3D"1223" data-end=3D"1265">un <strong data-start=3D"1226" dat=
a-end=3D"1245">routeur central</strong> (fichier <code data-start=3D"1255" =
data-end=3D"1264">urls.py</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1266" data-end=3D"1298">
<p data-start=3D"1268" data-end=3D"1298">la <strong data-start=3D"1271" dat=
a-end=3D"1298">configuration WSGI/ASGI</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1299" data-end=3D"1409">
<p data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1409">et une ou plusieurs <strong data-s=
tart=3D"1321" data-end=3D"1348">applications modulaires</strong> (<code dat=
a-start=3D"1350" data-end=3D"1356">apps</code>) que vous d=C3=A9velopperez =
pour structurer votre projet.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1411" data-end=3D"1537">
<p data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1537">=F0=9F=A7=91=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=8F=AB =
