<p data-start=3D"3653" data-end=3D"3743">Un <strong data-start=3D"3656" dat=
a-end=3D"3670">middleware</strong> est une couche interm=C3=A9diaire qui pe=
ut modifier la requ=C3=AAte ou la r=C3=A9ponse.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3745" data-end=3D"3764">Exemples int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3766" data-end=3D"3920">
<li data-start=3D"3766" data-end=3D"3818">
<p data-start=3D"3768" data-end=3D"3818"><code data-start=3D"3768" data-end=
=3D"3794">AuthenticationMiddleware</code> =E2=86=92 ajoute <code data-start=
=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3818">request.user</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3819" data-end=3D"3865">
<p data-start=3D"3821" data-end=3D"3865"><code data-start=3D"3821" data-end=
=3D"3840">SessionMiddleware</code> =E2=86=92 g=C3=A8re <code data-start=3D"=
3848" data-end=3D"3865">request.session</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3866" data-end=3D"3920">
<p data-start=3D"3868" data-end=3D"3920"><code data-start=3D"3868" data-end=
=3D"3888">SecurityMiddleware</code> =E2=86=92 force HTTPS, s=C3=A9curise he=
aders</p>
</li>
</ul>
