<h2 data-start=3D"5807" data-end=3D"5863">=F0=9F=A7=B0 12. Exercice pratiqu=
e : Blog et Shop avec conflits</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5865" data-end=3D"5891">Supposons deux apps avec :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"5976">
<li data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"5934">
<p data-start=3D"5895" data-end=3D"5934"><code data-start=3D"5895" data-end=
=3D"5903">/blog/</code> =E2=86=92 <code data-start=3D"5906" data-end=3D"591=
9">views.index</code> (name=3D'index')</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5935" data-end=3D"5976">
<p data-start=3D"5937" data-end=3D"5976"><code data-start=3D"5937" data-end=
=3D"5945">/shop/</code> =E2=86=92 <code data-start=3D"5948" data-end=3D"596=
1">views.index</code> (name=3D'index')</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5978" data-end=3D"6055">Test sans namespace =E2=86=92 =F0=
=9F=94=B4 erreur ou ambigu=C3=AFt=C3=A9<br data-start=3D"6022" data-end=3D"=
6025">
Test avec namespace =E2=86=92 =E2=9C=85 r=C3=A9solu</p>
