<h2 data-start=3D"6062" data-end=3D"6092">=F0=9F=94=84 13. Questions fr=C3=
=A9quentes</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6094" data-end=3D"6140">=E2=9D=93 Dois-je toujours utilis=
er un namespace ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6141" data-end=3D"6205"><strong data-start=3D"6141" data-e=
nd=3D"6148">Non</strong>, mais c=E2=80=99est recommand=C3=A9 d=C3=A8s que v=
ous avez plus d=E2=80=99une app.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6207" data-end=3D"6242">=E2=9D=93 <code data-start=3D"621=
3" data-end=3D"6223">app_name</code> est-il suffisant ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6243" data-end=3D"6348"><strong data-start=3D"6243" data-e=
nd=3D"6250">Oui</strong>, sauf si vous voulez un namespace diff=C3=A9rent a=
u moment d=E2=80=99inclure (<code data-start=3D"6316" data-end=3D"6347">inc=
lude(..., namespace=3D'...')</code>)</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6350" data-end=3D"6402">=E2=9D=93 Est-ce compatible avec =
Django REST Framework ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6403" data-end=3D"6502"><strong data-start=3D"6403" data-e=
nd=3D"6410">Oui</strong>, le syst=C3=A8me <code data-start=3D"6423" data-en=
d=3D"6442">router.register()</code> supporte aussi les <code data-start=3D"=
6462" data-end=3D"6472">basename</code> + namespace dans <code data-start=
=3D"6490" data-end=3D"6501">include()</code>.</p>
