<hr data-start=3D"6034" data-end=3D"6037">
<h2 data-start=3D"6039" data-end=3D"6084">=E2=9C=85 10. Meilleures pratique=
s avec les mixins</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6086" data-end=3D"6413">
<li data-start=3D"6086" data-end=3D"6141">
<p data-start=3D"6088" data-end=3D"6141">Un mixin =3D une responsabilit=C3=
=A9 claire (principe SOLID)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6142" data-end=3D"6212">
<p data-start=3D"6144" data-end=3D"6212">Utilisez des noms explicites (<cod=
e data-start=3D"6174" data-end=3D"6194">LoginRequiredMixin</code>, pas <cod=
e data-start=3D"6200" data-end=3D"6211">AuthMixin</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6213" data-end=3D"6274">
<p data-start=3D"6215" data-end=3D"6274">Ne m=C3=A9langez pas des logiques =
diff=C3=A9rentes dans un m=C3=AAme mixin</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6275" data-end=3D"6346">
<p data-start=3D"6277" data-end=3D"6346">Ne surchargez jamais <code data-st=
art=3D"6298" data-end=3D"6310">__init__()</code> dans un mixin (sauf except=
ion rare)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6347" data-end=3D"6413">
<p data-start=3D"6349" data-end=3D"6413">Testez vos mixins s=C3=A9par=C3=A9=
ment avec <code data-start=3D"6383" data-end=3D"6399">SimpleTestCase</code>=
 ou <code data-start=3D"6403" data-end=3D"6413">TestCase</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
