<hr data-start=3D"186" data-end=3D"189">
<h1 data-start=3D"191" data-end=3D"241">=F0=9F=93=9A 5.3 =E2=80=94 Requ=C3=
=AAtes ORM de base (CRUD) dans Django</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"243" data-end=3D"246">
<h2 data-start=3D"248" data-end=3D"263">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"265" data-end=3D"567">
<li data-start=3D"265" data-end=3D"327">
<p data-start=3D"267" data-end=3D"327">Comprendre comment manipuler les don=
n=C3=A9es via l=E2=80=99ORM de Django</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"328" data-end=3D"410">
<p data-start=3D"330" data-end=3D"410">Ma=C3=AEtriser les op=C3=A9rations C=
RUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) simples et avanc=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"411" data-end=3D"506">
<p data-start=3D"413" data-end=3D"506">D=C3=A9couvrir les m=C3=A9thodes et =
bonnes pratiques pour =C3=A9crire des requ=C3=AAtes efficaces et maintenabl=
es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"507" data-end=3D"567">
<p data-start=3D"509" data-end=3D"567">Savoir g=C3=A9rer les cas complexes,=
 relations et optimisations</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"569" data-end=3D"572">
<h2 data-start=3D"574" data-end=3D"607">1. Introduction =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99OR=
M Django</h2>
<p data-start=3D"609" data-end=3D"841">L=E2=80=99ORM (Object Relational Map=
ping) de Django est un syst=C3=A8me qui permet de manipuler les bases de do=
nn=C3=A9es relationnelles en utilisant du code Python orient=C3=A9 objet. V=
ous interagissez avec des <strong data-start=3D"798" data-end=3D"809">mod=
=C3=A8les</strong> et non directement avec du SQL.</p>
<p data-start=3D"843" data-end=3D"903">Les op=C3=A9rations CRUD sont la bas=
e de la gestion des donn=C3=A9es :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"905" data-end=3D"1088">
<li data-start=3D"905" data-end=3D"954">
<p data-start=3D"907" data-end=3D"954"><strong data-start=3D"907" data-end=
=3D"917">Create</strong> : cr=C3=A9er de nouvelles entr=C3=A9es en base</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"955" data-end=3D"1004">
<p data-start=3D"957" data-end=3D"1004"><strong data-start=3D"957" data-end=
=3D"965">Read</strong> : lire/extraire des donn=C3=A9es existantes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1005" data-end=3D"1051">
<p data-start=3D"1007" data-end=3D"1051"><strong data-start=3D"1007" data-e=
nd=3D"1017">Update</strong> : modifier des donn=C3=A9es existantes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1052" data-end=3D"1088">
<p data-start=3D"1054" data-end=3D"1088"><strong data-start=3D"1054" data-e=
nd=3D"1064">Delete</strong> : supprimer des donn=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
</ul>
