<h2 data-start=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1390">3. Q objects : requ=C3=AAtes dyna=
miques et logiques complexes</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"1392" data-end=3D"1395">
<h3 data-start=3D"1397" data-end=3D"1431">3.1 Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99=
un Q object ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1433" data-end=3D"1688">
<li data-start=3D"1433" data-end=3D"1482">
<p data-start=3D"1435" data-end=3D"1482">Un objet qui encapsule une express=
ion de filtre</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1483" data-end=3D"1581">
<p data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"1581">Permet de combiner plusieurs filtr=
es avec des op=C3=A9rateurs logiques <code data-start=3D"1551" data-end=3D"=
1554">&amp;</code> (AND), <code data-start=3D"1562" data-end=3D"1565">|</co=
de> (OR), <code data-start=3D"1572" data-end=3D"1575">~</code> (NOT)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1582" data-end=3D"1636">
<p data-start=3D"1584" data-end=3D"1636">Supporte les parenth=C3=A8ses pour=
 grouper les conditions</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1637" data-end=3D"1688">
<p data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1688">S=E2=80=99utilise dans <code data-=
start=3D"1654" data-end=3D"1664">filter()</code>, <code data-start=3D"1666"=
 data-end=3D"1677">exclude()</code> ou <code data-start=3D"1681" data-end=
=3D"1688">get()</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
