<h3 data-start=3D"5397" data-end=3D"5434">6.2 Eviter les requ=C3=AAtes co=
=C3=BBteuses</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5436" data-end=3D"5692">
<li data-start=3D"5436" data-end=3D"5535">
<p data-start=3D"5438" data-end=3D"5535">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"5447"=
 data-end=3D"5452">F()</code> pour faire des mises =C3=A0 jour en base, =C3=
=A9vitez de charger, modifier, puis sauvegarder</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5536" data-end=3D"5607">
<p data-start=3D"5538" data-end=3D"5607">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rez <code data-star=
t=3D"5547" data-end=3D"5552">Q()</code> pour =C3=A9viter plusieurs requ=C3=
=AAtes ou it=C3=A9rations en Python</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5608" data-end=3D"5692">
<p data-start=3D"5610" data-end=3D"5692">Testez toujours vos requ=C3=AAtes =
avec <code data-start=3D"5644" data-end=3D"5660">queryset.query</code> ou d=
ans la console Django shell</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5694" data-end=3D"5697">
<h3 data-start=3D"5699" data-end=3D"5726">6.3 Limitations connues</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5728" data-end=3D"6011">
