<hr data-start=3D"6609" data-end=3D"6612">
<h2 data-start=3D"6614" data-end=3D"6630">8. Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6632" data-end=3D"6783">Les <strong data-start=3D"6636" da=
ta-end=3D"6649">Q objects</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"6653" data-end=
=3D"6670">F expressions</strong> sont deux outils essentiels qui vous perme=
ttent de d=C3=A9passer les limitations des requ=C3=AAtes simples en Django =
ORM :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6785" data-end=3D"7005">
<li data-start=3D"6785" data-end=3D"6876">
<p data-start=3D"6787" data-end=3D"6876"><strong data-start=3D"6787" data-e=
nd=3D"6800">Q objects</strong> : pour construire des filtres complexes avec=
 logique bool=C3=A9enne (AND/OR/NOT)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6877" data-end=3D"7005">
<p data-start=3D"6879" data-end=3D"7005"><strong data-start=3D"6879" data-e=
nd=3D"6896">F expressions</strong> : pour effectuer des op=C3=A9rations et =
comparaisons sur les champs directement en base, sans charger les donn=C3=
=A9es</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7007" data-end=3D"7141">Ces concepts sont indispensables p=
our =C3=A9crire des requ=C3=AAtes performantes, claires et maintenables dan=
s des applications Django avanc=C3=A9es.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7143" data-end=3D"7146">
<h2 data-start=3D"7148" data-end=3D"7184">9. Prochaines =C3=A9tapes recomma=
nd=C3=A9es</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7186" data-end=3D"7540">
<li data-start=3D"7186" data-end=3D"7281">
<p data-start=3D"7188" data-end=3D"7281">Explorer l=E2=80=99annotation avan=
c=C3=A9e avec <code data-start=3D"7223" data-end=3D"7231">Func()</code>, <c=
ode data-start=3D"7233" data-end=3D"7241">Case()</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"7243" data-end=3D"7251">When()</code> pour conditions SQL complexes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7282" data-end=3D"7345">
<p data-start=3D"7284" data-end=3D"7345">Ma=C3=AEtriser les sous-requ=C3=AA=
tes avec <code data-start=3D"7317" data-end=3D"7329">Subquery()</code> et <=
code data-start=3D"7333" data-end=3D"7345">OuterRef()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7346" data-end=3D"7433">
<p data-start=3D"7348" data-end=3D"7433">Optimiser vos requ=C3=AAtes relati=
onnelles avec <code data-start=3D"7391" data-end=3D"7409">select_related()<=
/code> et <code data-start=3D"7413" data-end=3D"7433">prefetch_related()</c=
ode></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7434" data-end=3D"7540">
<p data-start=3D"7436" data-end=3D"7540">Approfondir la gestion des transac=
tions pour assurer la coh=C3=A9rence en cas de requ=C3=AAtes multiples comp=
lexes</p>
</li>
</ul>
