<ul data-start=3D"3506" data-end=3D"4014">
<li data-start=3D"3506" data-end=3D"3641">
<p data-start=3D"3508" data-end=3D"3641"><code data-start=3D"3508" data-end=
=3D"3554">ForeignKey(Auteur, on_delete=3Dmodels.CASCADE)</code> : chaque li=
vre appartient =C3=A0 un seul auteur, mais un auteur peut avoir plusieurs l=
ivres</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3642" data-end=3D"3947">
<p data-start=3D"3644" data-end=3D"3712"><code data-start=3D"3644" data-end=
=3D"3655">on_delete</code> g=C3=A8re ce qui arrive aux livres si l=E2=80=99=
auteur est supprim=C3=A9 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3715" data-end=3D"3947">
<li data-start=3D"3715" data-end=3D"3748">
<p data-start=3D"3717" data-end=3D"3748"><code data-start=3D"3717" data-end=
=3D"3726">CASCADE</code> : supprime les livres</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3751" data-end=3D"3817">
<p data-start=3D"3753" data-end=3D"3817"><code data-start=3D"3753" data-end=
=3D"3763">SET_NULL</code> : met =C3=A0 null la cl=C3=A9 =C3=A9trang=C3=A8re=
 (n=C3=A9cessite <code data-start=3D"3805" data-end=3D"3816">null=3DTrue</c=
ode>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3820" data-end=3D"3879">
<p data-start=3D"3822" data-end=3D"3879"><code data-start=3D"3822" data-end=
=3D"3831">PROTECT</code> : emp=C3=AAche la suppression si des livres existe=
nt</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3882" data-end=3D"3947">
<p data-start=3D"3884" data-end=3D"3947"><code data-start=3D"3884" data-end=
=3D"3896">DO_NOTHING</code> : ne fait rien (attention aux erreurs d=E2=80=
=99int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3948" data-end=3D"4014">
<p data-start=3D"3950" data-end=3D"4014"><code data-start=3D"3950" data-end=
=3D"3964">related_name</code> permet de personnaliser le nom d=E2=80=99attr=
ibut inverse</p>
</li>
</ul>
