<li data-start=3D"8059" data-end=3D"8148">
<p data-start=3D"8061" data-end=3D"8148"><strong data-start=3D"8061" data-e=
nd=3D"8075">ForeignKey</strong> : quand vous avez un =E2=80=9Cappartient =
