<li data-start=3D"5789" data-end=3D"6004">
<p data-start=3D"5791" data-end=3D"6004"><strong data-start=3D"5791" data-e=
nd=3D"5840">Ne pas surcharger les m=C3=A9thodes trop complexes</strong> : =
