<h3 data-start=3D"3638" data-end=3D"3658">3.3 Explications</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3660" data-end=3D"4001">
<li data-start=3D"3660" data-end=3D"3769">
<p data-start=3D"3662" data-end=3D"3769"><code data-start=3D"3662" data-end=
=3D"3700">@receiver(post_save, sender=3DArticle)</code> : on connecte la fo=
nction au signal <code data-start=3D"3737" data-end=3D"3748">post_save</cod=
e> du mod=C3=A8le <code data-start=3D"3759" data-end=3D"3768">Article</code=
>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3770" data-end=3D"3810">
<p data-start=3D"3772" data-end=3D"3810"><code data-start=3D"3772" data-end=
=3D"3780">sender</code> : mod=C3=A8le qui a =C3=A9mis le signal</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3811" data-end=3D"3873">
<p data-start=3D"3813" data-end=3D"3873"><code data-start=3D"3813" data-end=
=3D"3823">instance</code> : instance du mod=C3=A8le qui vient d=E2=80=99=C3=
=AAtre sauvegard=C3=A9e</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3874" data-end=3D"3963">
<p data-start=3D"3876" data-end=3D"3963"><code data-start=3D"3876" data-end=
=3D"3885">created</code> : bool=C3=A9en indiquant si l=E2=80=99objet a =C3=
=A9t=C3=A9 cr=C3=A9=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"3929" data-end=3D"3935">True=
</code>) ou juste modifi=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"3955" data-end=3D"3962"=
>False</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3964" data-end=3D"4001">
<p data-start=3D"3966" data-end=3D"4001"><code data-start=3D"3966" data-end=
=3D"3976">**kwargs</code> : arguments additionnels</p>
</li>
</ul>
