<h2 data-start=3D"5862" data-end=3D"5903">5. Gestion des param=C3=A8tres de=
s handlers</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5905" data-end=3D"5965">Chaque signal envoie des arguments=
 sp=C3=A9cifiques aux handlers.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5967" data-end=3D"5970">
<h3 data-start=3D"5972" data-end=3D"5999">5.1 Arguments standards</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6001" data-end=3D"6377">
<li data-start=3D"6001" data-end=3D"6030">
<p data-start=3D"6003" data-end=3D"6030"><code data-start=3D"6003" data-end=
=3D"6011">sender</code> : classe du mod=C3=A8le</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6031" data-end=3D"6060">
<p data-start=3D"6033" data-end=3D"6060"><code data-start=3D"6033" data-end=
=3D"6043">instance</code> : objet concern=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6061" data-end=3D"6137">
<p data-start=3D"6063" data-end=3D"6137"><code data-start=3D"6063" data-end=
=3D"6072">created</code> : (uniquement pour <code data-start=3D"6092" data-=
end=3D"6103">post_save</code>) bool=C3=A9en cr=C3=A9ation ou modification</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6138" data-end=3D"6193">
<p data-start=3D"6140" data-end=3D"6193"><code data-start=3D"6140" data-end=
=3D"6145">raw</code> : si la sauvegarde est brute (import, fixtures)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6194" data-end=3D"6242">
<p data-start=3D"6196" data-end=3D"6242"><code data-start=3D"6196" data-end=
=3D"6203">using</code> : alias de la base de donn=C3=A9es utilis=C3=A9e</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6243" data-end=3D"6294">
<p data-start=3D"6245" data-end=3D"6294"><code data-start=3D"6245" data-end=
=3D"6260">update_fields</code> : champs mis =C3=A0 jour dans <code data-sta=
rt=3D"6286" data-end=3D"6294">save()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6295" data-end=3D"6377">
<p data-start=3D"6297" data-end=3D"6377"><code data-start=3D"6297" data-end=
=3D"6305">action</code> : (pour <code data-start=3D"6314" data-end=3D"6327"=
>m2m_changed</code>) type d=E2=80=99action (pre_add, post_add, pre_remove..=
.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
