<hr data-start=3D"7801" data-end=3D"7804">
<h2 data-start=3D"7806" data-end=3D"7847">8. Bonnes pratiques et pi=C3=A8ge=
s =C3=A0 =C3=A9viter</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"7849" data-end=3D"7852">
<h3 data-start=3D"7854" data-end=3D"7887">8.1 Ne pas abuser des signals</h3=
>
<ul data-start=3D"7889" data-end=3D"8077">
<li data-start=3D"7889" data-end=3D"7944">
<p data-start=3D"7891" data-end=3D"7944">Les signals peuvent rendre le d=C3=
=A9bogage plus difficile</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7945" data-end=3D"7997">
<p data-start=3D"7947" data-end=3D"7997">Gardez les handlers simples, court=
s et pr=C3=A9visibles</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7998" data-end=3D"8077">
<p data-start=3D"8000" data-end=3D"8077">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rez des appels expl=
icites dans les vues ou m=C3=A9thodes quand c=E2=80=99est possible</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8079" data-end=3D"8082">
<h3 data-start=3D"8084" data-end=3D"8135">8.2 Attention aux side effects da=
ns les signals</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8137" data-end=3D"8287">
<li data-start=3D"8137" data-end=3D"8213">
<p data-start=3D"8139" data-end=3D"8213">Ne pas effectuer d=E2=80=99op=C3=
=A9rations longues ou bloquantes (ex : appels externes)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8214" data-end=3D"8287">
<p data-start=3D"8216" data-end=3D"8287">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rer d=C3=A9l=C3=A9g=
uer les t=C3=A2ches lourdes =C3=A0 des workers asynchrones (Celery)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8289" data-end=3D"8292">
<h3 data-start=3D"8294" data-end=3D"8333">8.3 Gestion des imports circulair=
es</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8335" data-end=3D"8560">
<li data-start=3D"8335" data-end=3D"8427">
<p data-start=3D"8337" data-end=3D"8427">Importer les modules contenant les=
 handlers dans <code data-start=3D"8386" data-end=3D"8395">ready()</code> =
=C3=A9vite les erreurs d=E2=80=99importation</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8428" data-end=3D"8560">
<p data-start=3D"8430" data-end=3D"8560">Toujours utiliser <code data-start=
=3D"8448" data-end=3D"8459">@receiver</code> pour connecter les handlers, p=
lut=C3=B4t que de connecter manuellement dans des fichiers souvent import=
=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8562" data-end=3D"8565">
<h2 data-start=3D"8567" data-end=3D"8609">9. Exemples concrets d=E2=80=99us=
age de signals</h2>
