<hr data-start=3D"4321" data-end=3D"4324">
<h3 data-start=3D"4326" data-end=3D"4357">5.2 Supprimer une migration</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4359" data-end=3D"4527">
<li data-start=3D"4359" data-end=3D"4404">
<p data-start=3D"4361" data-end=3D"4404">Supprimer manuellement le fichier =
migration</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4405" data-end=3D"4477">
<p data-start=3D"4407" data-end=3D"4477">Revenir =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat=
 ant=C3=A9rieur avec <code data-start=3D"4439" data-end=3D"4477">migrate ap=
p_nom migration_pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dente</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4478" data-end=3D"4527">
<p data-start=3D"4480" data-end=3D"4527">Puis recr=C3=A9er la migration ave=
c <code data-start=3D"4511" data-end=3D"4527">makemigrations</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4529" data-end=3D"4612"><strong data-start=3D"4529" data-e=
nd=3D"4544">Attention :</strong> cela peut =C3=AAtre risqu=C3=A9 en product=
ion si la base a d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 =C3=A9t=C3=A9 modifi=C3=A9e.</p>
