<h2 data-start=3D"822" data-end=3D"853">2. =E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F Fonctionnemen=
t interne</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"855" data-end=3D"879">2.1 <code data-start=3D"863" data-e=
nd=3D"879">makemigrations</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"881" data-end=3D"897">Cette commande :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"898" data-end=3D"1224">
<li data-start=3D"898" data-end=3D"964">
<p data-start=3D"900" data-end=3D"964">Inspecte tous les mod=C3=A8les (<cod=
e data-start=3D"927" data-end=3D"938">models.py</code>) dans les apps insta=
ll=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"965" data-end=3D"1046">
<p data-start=3D"967" data-end=3D"1046">Compare l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat actuel =
des mod=C3=A8les avec le dernier fichier de migration existant</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1047" data-end=3D"1147">
<p data-start=3D"1049" data-end=3D"1147">G=C3=A9n=C3=A8re un fichier de mig=
ration d=C3=A9crivant les changements (cr=C3=A9ation/suppression/ajout/modi=
fication)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1148" data-end=3D"1224">
<p data-start=3D"1150" data-end=3D"1224">Stocke ce fichier dans le dossier =
<code data-start=3D"1184" data-end=3D"1197">migrations/</code> de l=E2=80=
=99application concern=C3=A9e</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1226" data-end=3D"1279"><strong data-start=3D"1226" data-e=
nd=3D"1279">Mais elle ne modifie <em data-start=3D"1249" data-end=3D"1257">=
jamais</em> la base de donn=C3=A9es.</strong></p>
