<hr data-start=3D"3186" data-end=3D"3189">
<h2 data-start=3D"3191" data-end=3D"3217">6. =F0=9F=94=84 Ordre d'ex=C3=A9c=
ution</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3219" data-end=3D"3266">Toujours ex=C3=A9cuter les deux <s=
trong data-start=3D"3246" data-end=3D"3264">dans cet ordre</strong> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3268" data-end=3D"3369">
<li data-start=3D"3268" data-end=3D"3322">
<p data-start=3D"3271" data-end=3D"3322"><code data-start=3D"3271" data-end=
=3D"3287">makemigrations</code> : g=C3=A9n=C3=A8re les fichiers de migratio=
n</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3323" data-end=3D"3369">
<p data-start=3D"3326" data-end=3D"3369"><code data-start=3D"3326" data-end=
=3D"3335">migrate</code> : applique les fichiers =C3=A0 la base</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3371" data-end=3D"3374">
<h2 data-start=3D"3376" data-end=3D"3417">7. =E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F Probl=C3=A8=
mes fr=C3=A9quents et solutions</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3419" data-end=3D"3487">7.1 J'ai modifi=C3=A9 un mod=C3=
=A8le mais <code data-start=3D"3455" data-end=3D"3471">makemigrations</code=
> ne d=C3=A9tecte rien</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3489" data-end=3D"3703">
<li data-start=3D"3489" data-end=3D"3546">
<p data-start=3D"3491" data-end=3D"3546">L=E2=80=99application n=E2=80=99es=
t peut-=C3=AAtre pas dans <code data-start=3D"3530" data-end=3D"3546">INSTA=
LLED_APPS</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3547" data-end=3D"3605">
<p data-start=3D"3549" data-end=3D"3605">Vous avez peut-=C3=AAtre des migra=
tions en retard =C3=A0 appliquer</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3606" data-end=3D"3703">
<p data-start=3D"3608" data-end=3D"3703">Le champ modifi=C3=A9 ne change pa=
s le sch=C3=A9ma (e.g. modification d=E2=80=99une m=C3=A9thode ou d=E2=80=
=99une meta-classe)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3765">7.2 J=E2=80=99ai cr=C3=A9=C3=A9 d=
es migrations mais <code data-start=3D"3743" data-end=3D"3752">migrate</cod=
e> ne fait rien</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3767" data-end=3D"3874">
<li data-start=3D"3767" data-end=3D"3808">
<p data-start=3D"3769" data-end=3D"3808">Vous les avez peut-=C3=AAtre d=C3=
=A9j=C3=A0 appliqu=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3809" data-end=3D"3874">
<p data-start=3D"3811" data-end=3D"3874">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"3820"=
 data-end=3D"3853">python manage.py showmigrations</code> pour v=C3=A9rifie=
r l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat</p>
</li>
</ul>
