<hr data-start=3D"328" data-end=3D"331">
<h1 data-start=3D"333" data-end=3D"386">=F0=9F=8E=A8 7.3 =E2=80=94 Blocs et=
 h=C3=A9ritage de templates dans Django</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"388" data-end=3D"391">
<h2 data-start=3D"393" data-end=3D"421">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs p=C3=A9dagog=
iques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"423" data-end=3D"716">
<li data-start=3D"423" data-end=3D"471">
<p data-start=3D"425" data-end=3D"471">Comprendre le m=C3=A9canisme d=E2=80=
=99h=C3=A9ritage (<code data-start=3D"461" data-end=3D"470">extends</code>)=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"472" data-end=3D"532">
<p data-start=3D"474" data-end=3D"532">Utiliser des blocs (<code data-start=
