<h2 data-start=3D"5292" data-end=3D"5319">=F0=9F=94=90 10. S=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9 et cache</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5321" data-end=3D"5578">
<li data-start=3D"5321" data-end=3D"5423">
<p data-start=3D"5323" data-end=3D"5423"><strong data-start=3D"5323" data-e=
nd=3D"5339">Headers HTTP</strong> : Servez vos fichiers avec <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5367" data-end=3D"5391">Cache-Control: max-age</code> pour de meilleu=
res performances</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5424" data-end=3D"5515">
<p data-start=3D"5426" data-end=3D"5515"><strong data-start=3D"5426" data-e=
nd=3D"5437">Hashing</strong> avec <code data-start=3D"5443" data-end=3D"547=
1">ManifestStaticFilesStorage</code> pour =C3=A9viter les probl=C3=A8mes de=
 cache obsol=C3=A8te</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5516" data-end=3D"5578">
<p data-start=3D"5518" data-end=3D"5578"><strong data-start=3D"5518" data-e=
nd=3D"5525">CDN</strong> (Cloudflare, AWS CloudFront) pour r=C3=A9duire la =
latence</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5580" data-end=3D"5583">
<h2 data-start=3D"5585" data-end=3D"5638">=F0=9F=A7=AA 11. Tester le charge=
ment des fichiers statiques</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5640" data-end=3D"5663">a. En d=C3=A9veloppement</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5665" data-end=3D"5758">Django sert automatiquement les fi=
chiers depuis <code data-start=3D"5713" data-end=3D"5731">STATICFILES_DIRS<=
/code> et les <code data-start=3D"5739" data-end=3D"5748">static/</code> de=
s apps.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5760" data-end=3D"5780">b. En production</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5782" data-end=3D"5955">
<li data-start=3D"5782" data-end=3D"5827">
<p data-start=3D"5784" data-end=3D"5827">Ex=C3=A9cutez : <code data-start=
=3D"5795" data-end=3D"5827">python manage.py collectstatic</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5828" data-end=3D"5884">
<p data-start=3D"5830" data-end=3D"5884">V=C3=A9rifiez que les fichiers son=
t bien dans <code data-start=3D"5871" data-end=3D"5884">STATIC_ROOT</code><=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5885" data-end=3D"5955">
<p data-start=3D"5887" data-end=3D"5955">Configurez un serveur (Nginx, Apac=
he, etc.) pour servir ces fichiers</p>
</li>
</ul>
