<p data-start=3D"6127" data-end=3D"6178">Vous avez une <strong data-start=
=3D"6141" data-end=3D"6178">structure de donn=C3=A9es d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 d=C3=
=A9finie</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6179" data-end=3D"6230">
