<hr data-start=3D"6955" data-end=3D"6958">
<h2 data-start=3D"6960" data-end=3D"6987">=F0=9F=A7=AA Exercices recommand=
=C3=A9s</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"6989" data-end=3D"7307">
<li data-start=3D"6989" data-end=3D"7087">
<p data-start=3D"6992" data-end=3D"7087">Cr=C3=A9ez un formulaire de <stron=
g data-start=3D"7015" data-end=3D"7028">connexion</strong> avec une erreur =
globale si l=E2=80=99utilisateur n=E2=80=99est pas trouv=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7088" data-end=3D"7211">
<p data-start=3D"7091" data-end=3D"7118">Cr=C3=A9ez un <code data-start=3D"=
7100" data-end=3D"7111">ModelForm</code> avec :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7122" data-end=3D"7211">
<li data-start=3D"7122" data-end=3D"7146">
<p data-start=3D"7124" data-end=3D"7146">messages personnalis=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7150" data-end=3D"7183">
<p data-start=3D"7152" data-end=3D"7183">messages flash apr=C3=A8s soumissi=
on</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7187" data-end=3D"7211">
<p data-start=3D"7189" data-end=3D"7211">erreurs HTML stylis=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7212" data-end=3D"7307">
<p data-start=3D"7215" data-end=3D"7307">Impl=C3=A9mentez un champ de <stro=
ng data-start=3D"7239" data-end=3D"7271">confirmation de mot de passe</stro=
ng> avec une validation dans <code data-start=3D"7297" data-end=3D"7306">cl=
ean()</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"7309" data-end=3D"7312">
<h2 data-start=3D"7314" data-end=3D"7335">=F0=9F=A7=A9 Aller plus loin</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7337" data-end=3D"7520">
<li data-start=3D"7337" data-end=3D"7386">
<p data-start=3D"7339" data-end=3D"7386">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"7348"=
