6" data-end=3D"7386">FormSets</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7387" data-end=3D"7447">
<p data-start=3D"7389" data-end=3D"7447">Ajouter des <strong data-start=3D"=
7401" data-end=3D"7427">messages translatables</strong> avec <code data-sta=
rt=3D"7433" data-end=3D"7447">gettext_lazy</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7448" data-end=3D"7520">
<p data-start=3D"7450" data-end=3D"7520">Cr=C3=A9er un <strong data-start=
=3D"7459" data-end=3D"7473">middleware</strong> qui injecte des messages gl=
