<hr data-start=3D"5781" data-end=3D"5784">
<h2 data-start=3D"5786" data-end=3D"5814">9. =F0=9F=94=90 S=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9 et erreurs</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5816" data-end=3D"6061">
<li data-start=3D"5816" data-end=3D"5905">
<p data-start=3D"5818" data-end=3D"5905">Toujours inclure <code data-start=
=3D"5835" data-end=3D"5866">{{ formset.management_form }}</code> pour =C3=
=A9viter les erreurs de validation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5906" data-end=3D"6004">
<p data-start=3D"5908" data-end=3D"6004">Validez individuellement les formu=
laires vides avec <code data-start=3D"5960" data-end=3D"5980">form.has_chan=
ged()</code> ou <code data-start=3D"5984" data-end=3D"6003">form.cleaned_da=
ta</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6005" data-end=3D"6061">
<p data-start=3D"6007" data-end=3D"6061">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6016"=
 data-end=3D"6034">{% csrf_token %}</code> dans les formulaires POST.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6063" data-end=3D"6066">
<h2 data-start=3D"6068" data-end=3D"6097">10. =F0=9F=A7=A0 Cas d=E2=80=99us=
age avanc=C3=A9s</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6099" data-end=3D"6377">
<li data-start=3D"6099" data-end=3D"6160">
<p data-start=3D"6101" data-end=3D"6160">Interface de <strong data-start=3D=
"6114" data-end=3D"6129">facturation</strong> (plusieurs lignes de produits=
)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6161" data-end=3D"6198">
<p data-start=3D"6163" data-end=3D"6198">Gestion d=E2=80=99<strong data-sta=
rt=3D"6173" data-end=3D"6198">inscriptions en masse</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6199" data-end=3D"6273">
<p data-start=3D"6201" data-end=3D"6273">Formulaires d=C3=A9pendants (ex: p=
lusieurs adresses pour un seul utilisateur)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6274" data-end=3D"6377">
<p data-start=3D"6276" data-end=3D"6377"><strong data-start=3D"6276" data-e=
nd=3D"6297">FormSet imbriqu=C3=A9s</strong> (non support=C3=A9s nativement,=
 mais faisables avec JavaScript ou des libs externes)</p>
</li>
</ul>
