<hr data-start=3D"6583" data-end=3D"6586">
<h2 data-start=3D"6588" data-end=3D"6614">12. =F0=9F=A7=B0 Bonnes pratiques=
</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6616" data-end=3D"6956">
<li data-start=3D"6616" data-end=3D"6682">
<p data-start=3D"6618" data-end=3D"6682">N=E2=80=99utilisez pas tous les ch=
amps dans <code data-start=3D"6654" data-end=3D"6668">list_display</code> =
=E2=86=92 lisibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6683" data-end=3D"6728">
<p data-start=3D"6685" data-end=3D"6728">D=C3=A9finissez toujours un <code =
data-start=3D"6708" data-end=3D"6718">ordering</code> coh=C3=A9rent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6821">
<p data-start=3D"6731" data-end=3D"6821">Limitez les actions selon les r=C3=
=B4les (<code data-start=3D"6768" data-end=3D"6791">has_change_permission</=
code>, <code data-start=3D"6793" data-end=3D"6816">has_delete_permission</c=
ode>...).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6822" data-end=3D"6883">
<p data-start=3D"6824" data-end=3D"6883">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rez les <code data-=
start=3D"6837" data-end=3D"6846">inlines</code> pour les mod=C3=A8les li=C3=
=A9s en ForeignKey.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6884" data-end=3D"6956">
<p data-start=3D"6886" data-end=3D"6956">Documentez les m=C3=A9thodes dans =
<code data-start=3D"6915" data-end=3D"6927">ModelAdmin</code> (surtout cell=
es dynamiques).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6958" data-end=3D"6961">
<h2 data-start=3D"6963" data-end=3D"6978">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6980" data-end=3D"7303">La classe <code data-start=3D"6990=
" data-end=3D"7002">ModelAdmin</code> est un outil tr=C3=A8s puissant pour =
cr=C3=A9er une <strong data-start=3D"7045" data-end=3D"7115">interface admi=
n professionnelle, robuste, ergonomique et s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e</strong>. En=
 combinant les champs dynamiques, les m=C3=A9thodes personnalis=C3=A9es, le=
s <code data-start=3D"7186" data-end=3D"7195">inlines</code>, les actions e=
t les permissions, vous offrez une v=C3=A9ritable interface de gestion adap=
t=C3=A9e =C3=A0 vos utilisateurs.</p>
