irst:pt-[3px]"><div class=3D"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-=
words light"><p data-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"265">Voici un <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"9" data-end=3D"43">tutoriel complet et approfondi</strong> sur <stron=
g data-start=3D"48" data-end=3D"96">les actions personnalis=C3=A9es dans Dj=
ango Admin</strong> (section 9.5), allant du niveau d=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 ex=
pert. Ce m=C3=A9canisme permet d=E2=80=99automatiser des op=C3=A9rations su=
r plusieurs objets =C3=A0 la fois, depuis l=E2=80=99interface d=E2=80=99adm=
inistration.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"267" data-end=3D"270">
<h1 data-start=3D"272" data-end=3D"320">9.5 =E2=80=94 Actions personnalis=
=C3=A9es dans Django Admin</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"322" data-end=3D"325">
<h2 data-start=3D"327" data-end=3D"341">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectif</h2>
<p data-start=3D"343" data-end=3D"642">Les <strong data-start=3D"347" data-=
end=3D"373">actions personnalis=C3=A9es</strong> permettent d=E2=80=99ex=C3=
=A9cuter une fonction sur <strong data-start=3D"413" data-end=3D"439">une s=
=C3=A9lection d=E2=80=99objets</strong> dans l=E2=80=99admin. Cela peut all=
er de simples modifications en masse (mise =C3=A0 jour de champs, suppressi=
on conditionnelle) =C3=A0 des op=C3=A9rations plus avanc=C3=A9es (export CS=
V, envoi d=E2=80=99e-mails, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ration de PDF, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"644" data-end=3D"647">
<h2 data-start=3D"649" data-end=3D"663">=E2=9C=85 Pr=C3=A9requis</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"665" data-end=3D"805">
<li data-start=3D"665" data-end=3D"740">
<p data-start=3D"667" data-end=3D"740">Avoir un mod=C3=A8le Django (ex. : <=
code data-start=3D"697" data-end=3D"706">Produit</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"708" data-end=3D"718">Commande</code>, <code data-start=3D"720" data-en=
d=3D"733">Utilisateur</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"741" data-end=3D"805">
<p data-start=3D"743" data-end=3D"805">Avoir une interface d=E2=80=99admini=
stration configur=C3=A9e (<code data-start=3D"792" data-end=3D"804">ModelAd=
min</code>)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"807" data-end=3D"810">
<h2 data-start=3D"812" data-end=3D"837">=F0=9F=A7=B1 1. Principe de base</h=
2>
<p data-start=3D"839" data-end=3D"880">Une action personnalis=C3=A9e est si=
mplement :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"882" data-end=3D"1132">
<li data-start=3D"882" data-end=3D"1068">
<p data-start=3D"884" data-end=3D"930">Une <strong data-start=3D"888" data-=
end=3D"907">fonction Python</strong> prenant 3 param=C3=A8tres :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"1068">
<li data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"980">
<p data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D"980"><code data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D=
"947">modeladmin</code> : l=E2=80=99instance <code data-start=3D"961" data-=
end=3D"973">ModelAdmin</code> active</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"983" data-end=3D"1016">
<p data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1016"><code data-start=3D"985" data-end=
=3D"994">request</code> : l=E2=80=99objet HTTPRequest</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1019" data-end=3D"1068">
<p data-start=3D"1021" data-end=3D"1068"><code data-start=3D"1021" data-end=
=3D"1031">queryset</code> : l=E2=80=99ensemble des objets s=C3=A9lectionn=
=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1069" data-end=3D"1132">
<p data-start=3D"1071" data-end=3D"1132">Un <strong data-start=3D"1074" dat=
a-end=3D"1116">enregistrement dans la liste <code data-start=3D"1105" data-=
end=3D"1114">actions</code></strong> du <code data-start=3D"1120" data-end=
=3D"1132">ModelAdmin</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
