410" data-end=3D"446">syst=C3=A8me de permissions de Django</strong> (mod=
=C3=A8le <code data-start=3D"455" data-end=3D"461">auth</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"463" data-end=3D"520">
<p data-start=3D"465" data-end=3D"520">Apprendre =C3=A0 <strong data-start=
=3D"477" data-end=3D"520">restreindre l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 l=E2=80=
=99interface admin</strong></p>
