<h2 data-start=3D"1251" data-end=3D"1286">=F0=9F=94=90 II. Acc=C3=A8s =C3=
=A0 l'interface admin</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1288" data-end=3D"1320">1. Admin vs authentification</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1465">
<li data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1411">
<p data-start=3D"1324" data-end=3D"1411">Seuls les <strong data-start=3D"13=
34" data-end=3D"1384">utilisateurs authentifi=C3=A9s avec <code data-start=
=3D"1367" data-end=3D"1382">is_staff=3DTrue</code></strong> peuvent acc=C3=
=A9der =C3=A0 l'admin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1412" data-end=3D"1465">
<p data-start=3D"1414" data-end=3D"1465">Le champ <code data-start=3D"1423"=
 data-end=3D"1442">is_superuser=3DTrue</code> donne tous les droits.</p>
</li>
</ul>
