<p data-start=3D"383" data-end=3D"501">Django propose un syst=C3=A8me d=E2=
=80=99authentification complet d=C3=A8s l'installation. Il s=E2=80=99appuie=
 sur le mod=C3=A8le <code data-start=3D"482" data-end=3D"488">User</code> p=
