<h2 data-start=3D"6669" data-end=3D"6684">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6686" data-end=3D"6727">Le syst=C3=A8me de permissions de =
Django est :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6943">
<li data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6777">
<p data-start=3D"6731" data-end=3D"6777"><strong data-start=3D"6731" data-e=
nd=3D"6743">puissant</strong> avec ses permissions automatiques</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6778" data-end=3D"6840">
<p data-start=3D"6780" data-end=3D"6840"><strong data-start=3D"6780" data-e=
nd=3D"6792">flexible</strong> gr=C3=A2ce aux groupes et permissions personn=
alis=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6841" data-end=3D"6892">
<p data-start=3D"6843" data-end=3D"6892"><strong data-start=3D"6843" data-e=
nd=3D"6857">extensible</strong> avec des packages comme <code data-start=3D=
"6882" data-end=3D"6892">guardian</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6893" data-end=3D"6943">
<p data-start=3D"6895" data-end=3D"6943"><strong data-start=3D"6895" data-e=
nd=3D"6909">int=C3=A9grable</strong> dans les vues, templates et admin</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6945" data-end=3D"7031">Il est essentiel de penser =C3=A0 =
la <strong data-start=3D"6977" data-end=3D"7007">s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 d=C3=A8=
s la conception</strong> de vos vues et mod=C3=A8les.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7033" data-end=3D"7036">
<p data-start=3D"7038" data-end=3D"7099">Souhaitez-vous un <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"7056" data-end=3D"7092">exemple de projet complet Django</strong> ave=
c :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7101" data-end=3D"7274">
<li data-start=3D"7101" data-end=3D"7147">
<p data-start=3D"7103" data-end=3D"7147">Gestion des groupes et permissions=
 via admin</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7148" data-end=3D"7195">
<p data-start=3D"7150" data-end=3D"7195">Formulaires avec v=C3=A9rification=
 des permissions</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7196" data-end=3D"7226">
<p data-start=3D"7198" data-end=3D"7226">Vues s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es (CBV et =
FBV)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7227" data-end=3D"7274">
