<h1 data-start=3D"386" data-end=3D"439">=F0=9F=94=90 10.6 =E2=80=94 Middlew=
are d=E2=80=99authentification dans Django</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"441" data-end=3D"444">
<h2 data-start=3D"446" data-end=3D"461">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"463" data-end=3D"865">
<li data-start=3D"463" data-end=3D"513">
<p data-start=3D"465" data-end=3D"513">Comprendre ce qu=E2=80=99est un <str=
ong data-start=3D"489" data-end=3D"503">middleware</strong> en Django</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"514" data-end=3D"579">
<p data-start=3D"516" data-end=3D"579">=C3=89tudier le r=C3=B4le sp=C3=A9ci=
fique du <strong data-start=3D"546" data-end=3D"579">middleware d=E2=80=99a=
uthentification</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"580" data-end=3D"658">
<p data-start=3D"582" data-end=3D"658">Voir comment Django r=C3=A9cup=C3=A8=
re et g=C3=A8re l=E2=80=99utilisateur courant via ce middleware</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"659" data-end=3D"728">
<p data-start=3D"661" data-end=3D"728">Apprendre =C3=A0 personnaliser ou cr=
=C3=A9er un middleware d=E2=80=99authentification</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"797">
<p data-start=3D"731" data-end=3D"797">Savoir o=C3=B9 positionner ce middle=
ware dans la cha=C3=AEne des middlewares</p>
</li>
