<h3 data-start=3D"1637" data-end=3D"1651">Son r=C3=B4le :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1653" data-end=3D"1834">
<li data-start=3D"1653" data-end=3D"1710">
<p data-start=3D"1655" data-end=3D"1710"><strong data-start=3D"1655" data-e=
nd=3D"1682">R=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99utilisateur</strong> connect=C3=
=A9 depuis la session.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1711" data-end=3D"1772">
<p data-start=3D"1713" data-end=3D"1772">Ajouter un attribut <code data-sta=
rt=3D"1733" data-end=3D"1747">request.user</code> sur chaque requ=C3=AAte H=
TTP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1773" data-end=3D"1834">
<p data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1834">G=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat d=
=E2=80=99authentification tout au long de la requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1836" data-end=3D"1839">
<h3 data-start=3D"1841" data-end=3D"1877">Comment =C3=A7a marche concr=C3=
=A8tement ?</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"1879" data-end=3D"2239">
<li data-start=3D"1879" data-end=3D"2011">
<p data-start=3D"1882" data-end=3D"2011">Le middleware lit la session utili=
sateur (via le middleware de session <code data-start=3D"1953" data-end=3D"=
1972">SessionMiddleware</code> qui doit obligatoirement le pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9d=
er).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2012" data-end=3D"2062">
<p data-start=3D"2015" data-end=3D"2062">Il r=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re l=E2=80=99<c=
ode data-start=3D"2029" data-end=3D"2038">user_id</code> stock=C3=A9 dans l=
a session.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2063" data-end=3D"2160">
<p data-start=3D"2066" data-end=3D"2160">Il charge l=E2=80=99utilisateur de=
puis la base de donn=C3=A9es via le backend d=E2=80=99authentification conf=
igur=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2161" data-end=3D"2239">
<p data-start=3D"2164" data-end=3D"2239">Il ajoute l=E2=80=99objet utilisat=
eur (<code data-start=3D"2195" data-end=3D"2201">User</code> ou <code data-=
start=3D"2205" data-end=3D"2220">AnonymousUser</code>) =C3=A0 <code data-st=
art=3D"2224" data-end=3D"2238">request.user</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2241" data-end=3D"2244">
<h3 data-start=3D"2246" data-end=3D"2276">Pourquoi c=E2=80=99est important =
?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2278" data-end=3D"2447">Sans ce middleware, les vues n=E2=
=80=99auraient pas d=E2=80=99information sur l=E2=80=99utilisateur connect=
=C3=A9. <code data-start=3D"2364" data-end=3D"2378">request.user</code> ser=
ait inexistant, rendant toute v=C3=A9rification d=E2=80=99identit=C3=A9 imp=
ossible.</p>
