<hr data-start=3D"4911" data-end=3D"4914">
<h2 data-start=3D"4916" data-end=3D"4991">=F0=9F=94=84 VI. Middleware d=E2=
=80=99authentification et authentification bas=C3=A9e sur token</h2>
<p data-start=3D"4993" data-end=3D"5097">Pour les API REST, le middleware c=
lassique ne suffit pas car on utilise souvent des tokens (JWT, OAuth).</p>
<p data-start=3D"5099" data-end=3D"5151">Il faut alors cr=C3=A9er un middle=
ware personnalis=C3=A9 qui :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5153" data-end=3D"5279">
<li data-start=3D"5153" data-end=3D"5206">
<p data-start=3D"5155" data-end=3D"5206">R=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re le token dans l=
=E2=80=99en-t=C3=AAte HTTP Authorization</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5207" data-end=3D"5224">
<p data-start=3D"5209" data-end=3D"5224">Valide ce token</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5279">
<p data-start=3D"5227" data-end=3D"5279">Associe l=E2=80=99utilisateur corr=
espondant =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"5265" data-end=3D"5279">request.user</=
code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5281" data-end=3D"5284">
<h2 data-start=3D"5286" data-end=3D"5334">=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F VII. Middle=
ware, s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 et performances</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5336" data-end=3D"5596">
<li data-start=3D"5336" data-end=3D"5454">
<p data-start=3D"5338" data-end=3D"5454">Ne surchargez pas le middleware av=
ec des requ=C3=AAtes inutiles (=C3=A9vitez de faire plusieurs requ=C3=AAtes=
 DB par requ=C3=AAte HTTP).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5455" data-end=3D"5517">
<p data-start=3D"5457" data-end=3D"5517">Cachez les r=C3=A9sultats si possi=
ble (ex : utilisez la session).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5518" data-end=3D"5596">
<p data-start=3D"5520" data-end=3D"5596">Le middleware doit =C3=AAtre rapid=
e pour ne pas ralentir la cha=C3=AEne de traitement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5598" data-end=3D"5601">
<h2 data-start=3D"5603" data-end=3D"5629">=F0=9F=A7=AA VIII. Debug et tests=
</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5631" data-end=3D"5900">
<li data-start=3D"5631" data-end=3D"5741">
<p data-start=3D"5633" data-end=3D"5741">Pour v=C3=A9rifier que le middlewa=
re fonctionne, vous pouvez temporairement afficher <code data-start=3D"5713=
" data-end=3D"5727">request.user</code> dans une vue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5742" data-end=3D"5821">
<p data-start=3D"5744" data-end=3D"5821">Utilisez des outils comme <code da=
ta-start=3D"5770" data-end=3D"5779">print()</code>, <code data-start=3D"578=
1" data-end=3D"5790">logging</code> ou le debugger pour inspecter.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5822" data-end=3D"5900">
<p data-start=3D"5824" data-end=3D"5900">Testez les cas avec utilisateur co=
nnect=C3=A9, d=C3=A9connect=C3=A9, et sessions invalides.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5902" data-end=3D"5905">
<h2 data-start=3D"5907" data-end=3D"5942">=F0=9F=A7=A9 IX. Extensions et ca=
s avanc=C3=A9s</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5944" data-end=3D"5989">1. Middleware d=E2=80=99authentif=
ication multiple</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5991" data-end=3D"6054">Parfois, on veut combiner authenti=
fication session + API token.</p>
<p data-start=3D"6056" data-end=3D"6141">Exemple : middleware qui d=C3=A9te=
cte un token dans le header et sinon utilise la session.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6143" data-end=3D"6202">2. Middleware d=E2=80=99authentif=
ication asynchrone (Django 4+)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6204" data-end=3D"6334">Django 4 introduit la possibilit=
=C3=A9 de middleware asynchrones pour les ASGI. Les middleware d=E2=80=99au=
thentification peuvent =C3=AAtre adapt=C3=A9s.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6336" data-end=3D"6339">
<h2 data-start=3D"6341" data-end=3D"6356">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6358" data-end=3D"6832">
<li data-start=3D"6358" data-end=3D"6482">
<p data-start=3D"6360" data-end=3D"6482">Le middleware d=E2=80=99authentifi=
cation est <strong data-start=3D"6397" data-end=3D"6412">fondamental</stron=
g> pour g=C3=A9rer la session et r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99utilisateur =
dans chaque requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6483" data-end=3D"6594">
<p data-start=3D"6485" data-end=3D"6594">Django fournit un middleware robus=
te et pr=C3=AAt =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99emploi, mais vous pouvez le personnaliser =
selon vos besoins.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6595" data-end=3D"6704">
<p data-start=3D"6597" data-end=3D"6704">L=E2=80=99ordre des middlewares es=
t crucial, particuli=C3=A8rement <code data-start=3D"6651" data-end=3D"6670=
">SessionMiddleware</code> avant <code data-start=3D"6677" data-end=3D"6703=
">AuthenticationMiddleware</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6705" data-end=3D"6832">
<p data-start=3D"6707" data-end=3D"6832">Comprendre ce middleware permet de=
 mieux ma=C3=AEtriser l=E2=80=99authentification et de construire des syst=
=C3=A8mes s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s et performants.</p>
</li>
</ul>
