ification personnalis=C3=A9e (backend custom) dans Django</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"446" data-end=3D"449">
<h2 data-start=3D"451" data-end=3D"466">=F0=9F=8E=AF Objectifs</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"468" data-end=3D"813">
<li data-start=3D"468" data-end=3D"536">
<p data-start=3D"470" data-end=3D"536">Comprendre le r=C3=B4le des <strong =
data-start=3D"493" data-end=3D"524">backends d=E2=80=99authentification</st=
rong> dans Django</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"537" data-end=3D"593">
<p data-start=3D"539" data-end=3D"593">Savoir pourquoi et quand cr=C3=A9er =
un backend personnalis=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"594" data-end=3D"644">
<p data-start=3D"596" data-end=3D"644">Apprendre =C3=A0 d=C3=A9velopper un =
