<h2 data-start=3D"6794" data-end=3D"6809">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6811" data-end=3D"7124">
<li data-start=3D"6811" data-end=3D"6908">
<p data-start=3D"6813" data-end=3D"6908">Les backends personnalis=C3=A9s so=
nt la cl=C3=A9 pour adapter l=E2=80=99authentification aux besoins sp=C3=A9=
cifiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6909" data-end=3D"6987">
<p data-start=3D"6911" data-end=3D"6987">Ils permettent d=E2=80=99impl=C3=
=A9menter toute logique m=C3=A9tier li=C3=A9e =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99authentifica=
tion.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6988" data-end=3D"7050">
<p data-start=3D"6990" data-end=3D"7050">Bien configur=C3=A9s, ils cohabite=
nt avec les backends standards.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7051" data-end=3D"7124">
<p data-start=3D"7053" data-end=3D"7124">Tester votre backend est indispens=
able pour =C3=A9viter des failles ou bugs.</p>
