<p data-start=3D"2045" data-end=3D"2119">Django d=C3=A9tecte automatiquemen=
t les tests dans tous les modules <code data-start=3D"2108" data-end=3D"211=
8">tests.py</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2121" data-end=3D"2124">
<h3 data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2161">Commandes utiles pour les tests</=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2163" data-end=3D"2466">
<li data-start=3D"2163" data-end=3D"2233">
<p data-start=3D"2165" data-end=3D"2233"><code data-start=3D"2165" data-end=
=3D"2196">python manage.py test appname</code> =E2=80=94 Lancer les tests d=
=E2=80=99une app pr=C3=A9cise</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2234" data-end=3D"2300">
<p data-start=3D"2236" data-end=3D"2300"><code data-start=3D"2236" data-end=
=3D"2273">python manage.py test --verbosity=3D2</code> =E2=80=94 Afficher p=
lus de d=C3=A9tails</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2301" data-end=3D"2364">
<p data-start=3D"2303" data-end=3D"2364"><code data-start=3D"2303" data-end=
=3D"2337">python manage.py test --failfast</code> =E2=80=94 Arr=C3=AAter au=
 premier =C3=A9chec</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2365" data-end=3D"2466">
<p data-start=3D"2367" data-end=3D"2466"><code data-start=3D"2367" data-end=
=3D"2399">python manage.py test --keepdb</code> =E2=80=94 Ne pas recr=C3=A9=
er la base de donn=C3=A9es =C3=A0 chaque fois (pour acc=C3=A9l=C3=A9rer)</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2468" data-end=3D"2471">
<h3 data-start=3D"2473" data-end=3D"2499">Conseils pour d=C3=A9marrer</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2501" data-end=3D"2731">
<li data-start=3D"2501" data-end=3D"2553">
<p data-start=3D"2503" data-end=3D"2553">=C3=89crivez vos tests <strong dat=
a-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2553">en m=C3=AAme temps que votre code</stron=
g></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2554" data-end=3D"2607">
<p data-start=3D"2556" data-end=3D"2607">Testez toujours les cas normaux et=
 les cas d=E2=80=99erreur</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2608" data-end=3D"2675">
<p data-start=3D"2610" data-end=3D"2675">Commencez par des tests simples pu=
is complexifiez progressivement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2676" data-end=3D"2731">
<p data-start=3D"2678" data-end=3D"2731">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"2687"=
 data-end=3D"2696">setUp()</code> pour pr=C3=A9parer vos donn=C3=A9es commu=
nes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2733" data-end=3D"2736">
<h2 data-start=3D"2738" data-end=3D"2793">11.2 Test des vues, mod=C3=A8les =
et formulaires en Django</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"2795" data-end=3D"2798">
<h3 data-start=3D"2800" data-end=3D"2825">A. Tester les mod=C3=A8les</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2827" data-end=3D"2877">Le mod=C3=A8le est la couche c=C5=
=93ur qui g=C3=A8re les donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2879" data-end=3D"2913"><strong data-start=3D"2879" data-e=
nd=3D"2913">Ce qu=E2=80=99on teste sur un mod=C3=A8le :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"3016">
<li data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"2961">
<p data-start=3D"2917" data-end=3D"2961">Cr=C3=A9ation, modification, suppr=
ession d=E2=80=99objets</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2962" data-end=3D"2987">
<p data-start=3D"2964" data-end=3D"2987">M=C3=A9thodes personnalis=C3=A9es<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2988" data-end=3D"3016">
<p data-start=3D"2990" data-end=3D"3016">Contraintes et validations</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3018" data-end=3D"3021">
<p data-start=3D"3023" data-end=3D"3059"><strong data-start=3D"3023" data-e=
nd=3D"3059">Exemple simple de test de mod=C3=A8le</strong></p>
<p data-start=3D"3061" data-end=3D"3144">Supposons un mod=C3=A8le <code dat=
a-start=3D"3081" data-end=3D"3090">Article</code> avec un champ <code data-=
start=3D"3105" data-end=3D"3112">title</code> et une m=C3=A9thode <code dat=
a-start=3D"3128" data-end=3D"3143">get_summary()</code>.</p>
