<h3 data-start=3D"6392" data-end=3D"6418">3. Mocking et patching</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6535">Pour isoler les tests, utilisez la=
 librairie <code data-start=3D"6465" data-end=3D"6480">unittest.mock</code>=
 pour remplacer certaines fonctions ou appels externes.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6537" data-end=3D"6540">
<h2 data-start=3D"6542" data-end=3D"6568">E. Organisation avanc=C3=A9e</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6570" data-end=3D"6848">
<li data-start=3D"6570" data-end=3D"6684">
<p data-start=3D"6572" data-end=3D"6684">Cr=C3=A9ez des fichiers d=C3=A9di=
=C3=A9s (<code data-start=3D"6599" data-end=3D"6616">tests_models.py</code>=
, <code data-start=3D"6618" data-end=3D"6634">tests_views.py</code>, <code =
data-start=3D"6636" data-end=3D"6652">tests_forms.py</code>) pour une meill=
eure lisibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6685" data-end=3D"6771">
<p data-start=3D"6687" data-end=3D"6771">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6696"=
 data-end=3D"6704">pytest</code> et des plugins comme <code data-start=3D"6=
726" data-end=3D"6741">pytest-django</code> pour plus de fonctionnalit=C3=
=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6772" data-end=3D"6848">
<p data-start=3D"6774" data-end=3D"6848">Int=C3=A9grez les tests dans votre=
 CI/CD (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins=E2=80=A6).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6850" data-end=3D"6853">
<h2 data-start=3D"6855" data-end=3D"6871">F. Conclusion</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6873" data-end=3D"7264">
<li data-start=3D"6873" data-end=3D"6952">
<p data-start=3D"6875" data-end=3D"6952">Les tests sont indispensables pour=
 garantir la qualit=C3=A9 de vos projets Django.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6953" data-end=3D"7020">
<p data-start=3D"6955" data-end=3D"7020">Commencez par des tests simples su=
r mod=C3=A8les, vues et formulaires.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7021" data-end=3D"7109">
<p data-start=3D"7023" data-end=3D"7109">Progressez vers des tests plus com=
plexes (authentification, int=C3=A9gration, performance).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7110" data-end=3D"7181">
<p data-start=3D"7112" data-end=3D"7181">Profitez des outils Django pour =
=C3=A9crire des tests efficaces et clairs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7182" data-end=3D"7264">
<p data-start=3D"7184" data-end=3D"7264">L=E2=80=99automatisation des tests=
 facilite la maintenance et acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re les d=C3=A9ploiements.</p>
</li>
</ul>
