<hr data-start=3D"7945" data-end=3D"7948">
<h3 data-start=3D"7950" data-end=3D"7988">C. Bonnes pratiques CI pour Djang=
o</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7990" data-end=3D"8427">
<li data-start=3D"7990" data-end=3D"8067">
<p data-start=3D"7992" data-end=3D"8067"><strong data-start=3D"7992" data-e=
nd=3D"8021">Isoler la base de donn=C3=A9es</strong> : utilisez des bases de=
 test distinctes en CI</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8068" data-end=3D"8141">
<p data-start=3D"8070" data-end=3D"8141"><strong data-start=3D"8070" data-e=
nd=3D"8096">Cachez les d=C3=A9pendances</strong> pour acc=C3=A9l=C3=A9rer (=
actions GitHub ou cache pip)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8142" data-end=3D"8206">
<p data-start=3D"8144" data-end=3D"8206"><strong data-start=3D"8144" data-e=
nd=3D"8206">Inclure les tests unitaires, d=E2=80=99int=C3=A9gration et fonc=
tionnels</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8207" data-end=3D"8270">
<p data-start=3D"8209" data-end=3D"8270"><strong data-start=3D"8209" data-e=
nd=3D"8270">Utiliser la couverture de code pour surveiller la qualit=C3=A9<=
/strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8271" data-end=3D"8341">
<p data-start=3D"8273" data-end=3D"8341"><strong data-start=3D"8273" data-e=
nd=3D"8341">Automatiser les d=C3=A9ploiements en staging ou prod apr=C3=A8s=
 validation</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8342" data-end=3D"8427">
<p data-start=3D"8344" data-end=3D"8427"><strong data-start=3D"8344" data-e=
nd=3D"8427">Prot=C3=A9ger la branche principale avec des r=C3=A8gles de mer=
ge conditionn=C3=A9es aux tests</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8429" data-end=3D"8432">
<h3 data-start=3D"8434" data-end=3D"8481">D. Tester avec Selenium ou Playwr=
ight en CI</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8483" data-end=3D"8768">
<li data-start=3D"8483" data-end=3D"8565">
<p data-start=3D"8485" data-end=3D"8565">Ajoutez un service <code data-star=
t=3D"8504" data-end=3D"8532">selenium/standalone-chrome</code> dans GitHub =
Actions ou GitLab CI</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8566" data-end=3D"8655">
<p data-start=3D"8568" data-end=3D"8655">Configurez le navigateur headless =
(<code data-start=3D"8603" data-end=3D"8615">--headless</code>) pour ex=C3=
=A9cuter sans interface graphique</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8656" data-end=3D"8710">
<p data-start=3D"8658" data-end=3D"8710">Installez les WebDrivers n=C3=A9ce=
ssaires dans l=E2=80=99image CI</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8711" data-end=3D"8768">
<p data-start=3D"8713" data-end=3D"8768">Lancez vos tests fonctionnels apr=
=C3=A8s les tests unitaires</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8770" data-end=3D"8773">
