<hr data-start=3D"3298" data-end=3D"3301">
<h3 data-start=3D"3303" data-end=3D"3335">2.3. Tester votre middleware</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3337" data-end=3D"3430">Lancez votre serveur et observez l=
a console : =C3=A0 chaque requ=C3=AAte, les messages seront affich=C3=A9s.<=
/p>
<hr data-start=3D"3432" data-end=3D"3435">
<h3 data-start=3D"3437" data-end=3D"3453">2.4. Analyse</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3455" data-end=3D"3814">
<li data-start=3D"3455" data-end=3D"3539">
<p data-start=3D"3457" data-end=3D"3539">La m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=
=3D"3468" data-end=3D"3478">__init__</code> est appel=C3=A9e une seule fois=
 lors du chargement du middleware.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3540" data-end=3D"3593">
<p data-start=3D"3542" data-end=3D"3593">La m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=
=3D"3553" data-end=3D"3563">__call__</code> est appel=C3=A9e =C3=A0 chaque =
requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3594" data-end=3D"3692">
<p data-start=3D"3596" data-end=3D"3692"><code data-start=3D"3596" data-end=
=3D"3610">get_response</code> est une fonction qui repr=C3=A9sente la suite=
 du pipeline (vue + middleware suivants).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3693" data-end=3D"3757">
<p data-start=3D"3695" data-end=3D"3757">Vous pouvez modifier <code data-st=
art=3D"3716" data-end=3D"3725">request</code> avant d=E2=80=99appeler <code=
 data-start=3D"3742" data-end=3D"3756">get_response</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3758" data-end=3D"3814">
<p data-start=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3814">Vous pouvez modifier <code data-st=
art=3D"3781" data-end=3D"3791">response</code> avant de le retourner.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3816" data-end=3D"3819">
<h2 data-start=3D"3821" data-end=3D"3918">Partie 3 =E2=80=94 Middleware ava=
nc=C3=A9 : gestion des exceptions et processus asynchrones (niveau avanc=C3=
=A9)</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"3920" data-end=3D"3923">
