<hr data-start=3D"4047" data-end=3D"4050">
<h3 data-start=3D"4052" data-end=3D"4086">3.1. Exploiter la requ=C3=AAte HT=
TP</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4088" data-end=3D"4196">Le param=C3=A8tre <code data-start=
=3D"4101" data-end=3D"4110">request</code> pass=C3=A9 au context processor =
permet d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 toutes les donn=C3=A9es li=C3=A9es =C3=
=A0 la requ=C3=AAte :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4198" data-end=3D"4392">
<li data-start=3D"4198" data-end=3D"4236">
<p data-start=3D"4200" data-end=3D"4236"><code data-start=3D"4200" data-end=
=3D"4214">request.user</code> (utilisateur courant)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4237" data-end=3D"4268">
<p data-start=3D"4239" data-end=3D"4268"><code data-start=3D"4239" data-end=
=3D"4253">request.path</code> (URL demand=C3=A9e)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4269" data-end=3D"4310">
<p data-start=3D"4271" data-end=3D"4310"><code data-start=3D"4271" data-end=
=3D"4288">request.session</code> (session utilisateur)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4311" data-end=3D"4366">
<p data-start=3D"4313" data-end=3D"4366"><code data-start=3D"4313" data-end=
=3D"4326">request.GET</code>, <code data-start=3D"4328" data-end=3D"4342">r=
equest.POST</code> (param=C3=A8tres de requ=C3=AAte)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4367" data-end=3D"4392">
<p data-start=3D"4369" data-end=3D"4392"><code data-start=3D"4369" data-end=
=3D"4386">request.COOKIES</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4394" data-end=3D"4455">Cela permet de calculer dynamiquem=
ent les valeurs =C3=A0 injecter.</p>
