<hr data-start=3D"5530" data-end=3D"5533">
<h3 data-start=3D"5535" data-end=3D"5571">3.3. Impact sur les performances<=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"5573" data-end=3D"5653">Attention, les context processors =
s=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cutent =C3=A0 chaque rendu de template, donc :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5655" data-end=3D"5856">
<li data-start=3D"5655" data-end=3D"5714">
<p data-start=3D"5657" data-end=3D"5714">N=E2=80=99ajoutez pas de logique t=
rop lourde ou co=C3=BBteuse en base.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5715" data-end=3D"5784">
<p data-start=3D"5717" data-end=3D"5784">Pour des calculs complexes, pensez=
 =C3=A0 mettre en cache les r=C3=A9sultats.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5785" data-end=3D"5856">
<p data-start=3D"5787" data-end=3D"5856">=C3=89vitez les requ=C3=AAtes redo=
ndantes si vous rendez souvent des templates.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5858" data-end=3D"5861">
<h3 data-start=3D"5863" data-end=3D"5904">3.4. Context processors et middle=
ware</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5906" data-end=3D"6054">Un context processor d=C3=A9pend s=
ouvent de la pr=C3=A9sence de certains middleware, comme <code data-start=
=3D"5987" data-end=3D"6013">AuthenticationMiddleware</code> pour que <code =
data-start=3D"6023" data-end=3D"6037">request.user</code> soit accessible.<=
/p>
<hr data-start=3D"6056" data-end=3D"6059">
<h3 data-start=3D"6061" data-end=3D"6114">3.5. Passer des donn=C3=A9es hors=
 contexte de template</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6116" data-end=3D"6234">Les context processors n=E2=80=99i=
mpactent <strong data-start=3D"6151" data-end=3D"6158">que</strong> le cont=
exte des templates, pas les donn=C3=A9es JSON des API ou autres r=C3=A9pons=
es.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6236" data-end=3D"6239">
<h2 data-start=3D"6241" data-end=3D"6276">Partie 4 =E2=80=94 Cas pratiques =
experts</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"6278" data-end=3D"6281">
