<h3 data-start=3D"1416" data-end=3D"1454">1.2. Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s cl=C3=
=A9s d=E2=80=99un QuerySet</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1456" data-end=3D"1734">
<li data-start=3D"1456" data-end=3D"1561">
<p data-start=3D"1458" data-end=3D"1561"><strong data-start=3D"1458" data-e=
nd=3D"1466">Lazy</strong> : Les requ=C3=AAtes SQL ne sont ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9=
es que lorsque c=E2=80=99est n=C3=A9cessaire (par exemple =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=
it=C3=A9ration).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1562" data-end=3D"1645">
<p data-start=3D"1564" data-end=3D"1645"><strong data-start=3D"1564" data-e=
nd=3D"1577">Cha=C3=AEnable</strong> : Vous pouvez encha=C3=AEner plusieurs =
m=C3=A9thodes pour affiner la requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1646" data-end=3D"1734">
<p data-start=3D"1648" data-end=3D"1734"><strong data-start=3D"1648" data-e=
nd=3D"1660">Immuable</strong> : Chaque op=C3=A9ration retourne un nouveau Q=
uerySet sans modifier l=E2=80=99original.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1736" data-end=3D"1739">
<h3 data-start=3D"1741" data-end=3D"1780">1.3. Limites du QuerySet par d=C3=
=A9faut</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1782" data-end=3D"1950">
<li data-start=3D"1782" data-end=3D"1868">
<p data-start=3D"1784" data-end=3D"1868">Les requ=C3=AAtes fr=C3=A9quentes =
ou complexes sont r=C3=A9p=C3=A9t=C3=A9es dans plusieurs vues ou fonctions.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1869" data-end=3D"1894">
<p data-start=3D"1871" data-end=3D"1894">La duplication de code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1895" data-end=3D"1950">
<p data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1950">Manque d=E2=80=99une API claire sp=
=C3=A9cifique au domaine m=C3=A9tier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1952" data-end=3D"1955">
<h2 data-start=3D"1957" data-end=3D"2031">Partie 2 =E2=80=94 Cr=C3=A9er un =
