<hr data-start=3D"2033" data-end=3D"2036">
<h3 data-start=3D"2038" data-end=3D"2088">2.1. Pourquoi cr=C3=A9er un Query=
Set personnalis=C3=A9 ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2090" data-end=3D"2096">Pour :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2098" data-end=3D"2255">
<li data-start=3D"2098" data-end=3D"2134">
<p data-start=3D"2100" data-end=3D"2134">Encapsuler des filtres r=C3=A9curr=
ents.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2135" data-end=3D"2184">
<p data-start=3D"2137" data-end=3D"2184">Faciliter la lecture et la mainten=
ance du code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2185" data-end=3D"2255">
<p data-start=3D"2187" data-end=3D"2255">Ajouter des m=C3=A9thodes m=C3=A9t=
iers sp=C3=A9cifiques =C3=A0 la s=C3=A9lection des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
