<ul data-start=3D"4847" data-end=3D"4981">
<li data-start=3D"4847" data-end=3D"4866">
<p data-start=3D"4849" data-end=3D"4866">Code plus concis.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4867" data-end=3D"4907">
<p data-start=3D"4869" data-end=3D"4907">Pas besoin d=E2=80=99=C3=A9crire u=
