<hr data-start=3D"5609" data-end=3D"5612">
<h3 data-start=3D"5614" data-end=3D"5659">3.5. Diff=C3=A9rence avec les sig=
naux int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9s</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5661" data-end=3D"5801">
<li data-start=3D"5661" data-end=3D"5713">
<p data-start=3D"5663" data-end=3D"5713">Vous contr=C3=B4lez quand et comme=
nt =C3=A9mettre le signal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5714" data-end=3D"5756">
<p data-start=3D"5716" data-end=3D"5756">Vous d=C3=A9finissez les arguments=
 (payload).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5757" data-end=3D"5801">
<p data-start=3D"5759" data-end=3D"5801">Plus flexible, adapt=C3=A9 =C3=A0 =
la logique m=C3=A9tier.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5803" data-end=3D"5806">
<h2 data-start=3D"5808" data-end=3D"5865">Partie 4 =E2=80=94 Signaux et bon=
nes pratiques (niveau expert)</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"5867" data-end=3D"5870">
<h3 data-start=3D"5872" data-end=3D"5918">4.1. Gestion des performances et =
fiabilit=C3=A9</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5920" data-end=3D"6189">
<li data-start=3D"5920" data-end=3D"6011">
<p data-start=3D"5922" data-end=3D"6011"><strong data-start=3D"5922" data-e=
nd=3D"5956">Attention aux effets de bord :</strong> Les signaux peuvent ral=
entir des op=C3=A9rations critiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6012" data-end=3D"6119">
<p data-start=3D"6014" data-end=3D"6119"><strong data-start=3D"6014" data-e=
nd=3D"6049">Utiliser des t=C3=A2ches asynchrones</strong> (ex: Celery) pour=
 les actions longues (envoi d=E2=80=99email, notifications).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6120" data-end=3D"6189">
<p data-start=3D"6122" data-end=3D"6189"><strong data-start=3D"6122" data-e=
nd=3D"6157">=C3=89viter la logique m=C3=A9tier lourde</strong> directement =
dans les receivers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6191" data-end=3D"6194">
<h3 data-start=3D"6196" data-end=3D"6227">4.2. Pr=C3=A9vention des erreurs<=
/h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6229" data-end=3D"6407">
<li data-start=3D"6229" data-end=3D"6335">
<p data-start=3D"6231" data-end=3D"6335">Toujours pr=C3=A9voir un try/excep=
t dans les r=C3=A9cepteurs pour =C3=A9viter que l=E2=80=99erreur bloque la =
requ=C3=AAte d=E2=80=99origine.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6336" data-end=3D"6407">
<p data-start=3D"6338" data-end=3D"6407">Parfois, on veut que les exception=
s remontent (cas tr=C3=A8s sp=C3=A9cifiques).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6409" data-end=3D"6412">
<h3 data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6458">4.3. Connexion et d=C3=A9connexio=
n dynamiques</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6460" data-end=3D"6568">
<li data-start=3D"6460" data-end=3D"6568">
<p data-start=3D"6462" data-end=3D"6568">On peut connecter/d=C3=A9connecter=
 un r=C3=A9cepteur dynamiquement avec <code data-start=3D"6524" data-end=3D=
"6542">signal.connect()</code> et <code data-start=3D"6546" data-end=3D"656=
7">signal.disconnect()</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
