<h2 data-start=3D"5115" data-end=3D"5149">=F0=9F=A7=AA 7. Tests et bonnes p=
ratiques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5151" data-end=3D"5415">
<li data-start=3D"5151" data-end=3D"5224">
<p data-start=3D"5153" data-end=3D"5224">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"5162"=
 data-end=3D"5201">assertContains(response, "Bienvenue")</code> dans vos te=
sts de vue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5297">
