<h2 data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"761">=F0=9F=93=98 13.1 Introduction aux =
API REST avec DRF</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"763" data-end=3D"794">Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99une AP=
I REST ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"796" data-end=3D"891">REST (Representational State Transfe=
r) est un style d=E2=80=99architecture pour concevoir des API web :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"893" data-end=3D"983">
<li data-start=3D"893" data-end=3D"910">
<p data-start=3D"895" data-end=3D"910">=F0=9F=93=A5 <code data-start=3D"898=
" data-end=3D"903">GET</code> : lire</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"911" data-end=3D"930">
<p data-start=3D"913" data-end=3D"930">=E2=9C=8F=EF=B8=8F <code data-start=
=3D"916" data-end=3D"922">POST</code> : cr=C3=A9er</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"931" data-end=3D"958">
<p data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"958">=F0=9F=A7=BD <code data-start=3D"936=
" data-end=3D"947">PUT/PATCH</code> : modifier</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"959" data-end=3D"983">
<p data-start=3D"961" data-end=3D"983">=E2=9D=8C <code data-start=3D"963" d=
ata-end=3D"971">DELETE</code> : supprimer</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1004">Objectif de DRF</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1006" data-end=3D"1053">DRF est une surcouche de Django qu=
i permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1055" data-end=3D"1191">
<li data-start=3D"1055" data-end=3D"1082">
<p data-start=3D"1057" data-end=3D"1082">cr=C3=A9er des API facilement,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1083" data-end=3D"1139">
<p data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1139">g=C3=A9rer la s=C3=A9rialisation d=
e donn=C3=A9es (<code data-start=3D"1120" data-end=3D"1137">JSON &lt;-&gt; =
objets</code>),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1191">
<p data-start=3D"1142" data-end=3D"1191">ajouter des autorisations, de la p=
agination, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
