<hr data-start=3D"2821" data-end=3D"2824">
<h3 data-start=3D"2826" data-end=3D"2841">C. Conseils</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2843" data-end=3D"3056">
<li data-start=3D"2843" data-end=3D"2912">
<p data-start=3D"2845" data-end=3D"2912">Ne jamais assembler des requ=C3=AA=
tes SQL via f-string ou concat=C3=A9nation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2913" data-end=3D"2989">
<p data-start=3D"2915" data-end=3D"2989">Utiliser les fonctions ORM (<code =
data-start=3D"2943" data-end=3D"2951">filter</code>, <code data-start=3D"29=
53" data-end=3D"2961">update</code>, etc.) autant que possible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2990" data-end=3D"3056">
<p data-start=3D"2992" data-end=3D"3056">Si you must use raw SQL, utilisez =
les param=C3=A8tres li=C3=A9s du driver.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3058" data-end=3D"3061">
<h2 data-start=3D"3063" data-end=3D"3100">=F0=9F=94=8E 4. Autres protection=
s int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9es</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"3102" data-end=3D"3383">
<li data-start=3D"3102" data-end=3D"3181">
<p data-start=3D"3104" data-end=3D"3181"><strong data-start=3D"3104" data-e=
nd=3D"3120">Clickjacking</strong> : via <code data-start=3D"3127" data-end=
=3D"3144">X-Frame-Options</code> ajout=C3=A9 par <code data-start=3D"3156" =
data-end=3D"3181">XFrameOptionsMiddleware</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3182" data-end=3D"3281">
<p data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3281"><strong data-start=3D"3184" data-e=
nd=3D"3213">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des headers HTTP</strong> : <code data-start=
=3D"3216" data-end=3D"3236">SecurityMiddleware</code> configure HSTS, X-Con=
tent-Type-Options, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3282" data-end=3D"3383">
<p data-start=3D"3284" data-end=3D"3383"><strong data-start=3D"3284" data-e=
nd=3D"3308">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des cookies</strong> : <code data-start=3D"3=
311" data-end=3D"3334">SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE</code>, <code data-start=3D"33=
36" data-end=3D"3356">CSRF_COOKIE_SECURE</code>, <code data-start=3D"3358" =
data-end=3D"3383">SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3388">
<h1 data-start=3D"3390" data-end=3D"3448">14.2 Meilleures pratiques en conf=
iguration de production</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"3450" data-end=3D"3453">
<h2 data-start=3D"3455" data-end=3D"3479">=F0=9F=94=A7 1. <code data-start=
=3D"3464" data-end=3D"3479">DEBUG =3D False</code></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"3481" data-end=3D"3617">
<li data-start=3D"3481" data-end=3D"3530">
<p data-start=3D"3483" data-end=3D"3530">Ne jamais laisser <code data-start=
=3D"3501" data-end=3D"3515">DEBUG =3D True</code> en production.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3531" data-end=3D"3617">
<p data-start=3D"3533" data-end=3D"3617">Toujours configurer <code data-sta=
rt=3D"3553" data-end=3D"3568">ALLOWED_HOSTS</code> pour =C3=A9viter l=E2=80=
=99ex=C3=A9cution sur serveurs inattendus.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3619" data-end=3D"3622">
<h2 data-start=3D"3624" data-end=3D"3647">=F0=9F=8C=90 2. S=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9 HTTPS</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"3649" data-end=3D"3838">
<li data-start=3D"3649" data-end=3D"3714">
<p data-start=3D"3651" data-end=3D"3714">Configurer SSL (via nginx, Apache =
ou plateformes comme Heroku).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3715" data-end=3D"3807">
<p data-start=3D"3717" data-end=3D"3807">Activer HSTS via <code data-start=
=3D"3734" data-end=3D"3766">SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS =3D 31536000</code>, <code =
data-start=3D"3768" data-end=3D"3807">SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS =3D Tr=
ue</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3808" data-end=3D"3838">
<p data-start=3D"3810" data-end=3D"3838">Utiliser cookies s=C3=A9curis=C3=
=A9s :</p>
</li>
</ul>
