<ul data-start=3D"7748" data-end=3D"8022">
<li data-start=3D"7748" data-end=3D"7848">
<p data-start=3D"7750" data-end=3D"7848">Donner acc=C3=A8s via un provider =
(<code data-start=3D"7780" data-end=3D"7796">django-allauth</code>, <code d=
ata-start=3D"7798" data-end=3D"7822">social-auth-app-django</code>, <code d=
ata-start=3D"7824" data-end=3D"7846">django-oauth-toolkit</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7849" data-end=3D"7911">
<p data-start=3D"7851" data-end=3D"7911">Avantages : meilleurs UX, pas de m=
ot de passe propri=C3=A9taires.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7912" data-end=3D"8022">
<p data-start=3D"7914" data-end=3D"8022">Assurez-vous de configurer correct=
ement les <code data-start=3D"7958" data-end=3D"7973">redirect_uris</code>,=
 les scopes, et les tokens (dur=C3=A9es, r=C3=A9vocation).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8024" data-end=3D"8027">
<h2 data-start=3D"8029" data-end=3D"8075">=F0=9F=94=8D 5. Multitenant et is=
olation des sessions</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"8077" data-end=3D"8211">
<li data-start=3D"8077" data-end=3D"8142">
<p data-start=3D"8079" data-end=3D"8142">Utiliser un backend de sessions is=
ol=C3=A9 par client/environnement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8143" data-end=3D"8211">
<p data-start=3D"8145" data-end=3D"8211">Eviter partage des sessions entre =
tenants pour la confidentialit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8213" data-end=3D"8216">
<h2 data-start=3D"8218" data-end=3D"8250">=F0=9F=93=9D 6. Rotations du secr=
et key</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"8252" data-end=3D"8408">
<li data-start=3D"8252" data-end=3D"8323">
<p data-start=3D"8254" data-end=3D"8323">Pour invalider toutes les sessions=
 (aucune requ=C3=AAte ne sera accept=C3=A9e).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8324" data-end=3D"8408">
<p data-start=3D"8326" data-end=3D"8408">Rotation du secret doit provoquer =
une d=C3=A9connexion forc=C3=A9e de tous les utilisateurs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8410" data-end=3D"8413">
