<li data-start=3D"8442" data-end=3D"8559">
<p data-start=3D"8444" data-end=3D"8559">Utiliser Ola DSLs ou test framewor=
ks de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 (ex: <code data-start=3D"8498" data-end=3D"8507">z=
aproxy</code>, <code data-start=3D"8509" data-end=3D"8520">owasp zap</code>=
) pour tester CSRF, XSS, et injections.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8560" data-end=3D"8649">
