<ul data-start=3D"2117" data-end=3D"2247">
<li data-start=3D"2117" data-end=3D"2196">
<p data-start=3D"2119" data-end=3D"2196">Utilisez <strong data-start=3D"212=
8" data-end=3D"2138">Argon2</strong> si possible : moderne, lent (anti-brut=
e force), s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2197" data-end=3D"2247">
<p data-start=3D"2199" data-end=3D"2247">Sinon, <strong data-start=3D"2206"=
 data-end=3D"2228">PBKDF2 avec SHA256</strong> est aussi robuste.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2299">
<p data-start=3D"2251" data-end=3D"2299">Installez Argon2 avec <code data-s=
tart=3D"2273" data-end=3D"2298">pip install argon2-cffi</code>.</p>
</blockquote>
