<h2 data-start=3D"2514" data-end=3D"2540">=F0=9F=94=90 1. HTTPS obligatoire=
</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"2542" data-end=3D"2675">
<li data-start=3D"2542" data-end=3D"2595">
<p data-start=3D"2544" data-end=3D"2595">Toutes les communications doivent =
passer via HTTPS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2596" data-end=3D"2675">
