<p data-start=3D"2364" data-end=3D"2430">Heroku g=C3=A8re le scaling, les l=
ogs, et la base PostgreSQL pour vous.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2432" data-end=3D"2435">
<h3 data-start=3D"2437" data-end=3D"2458">=E2=9C=85 AWS (EC2 + RDS)</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2460" data-end=3D"2694">
<li data-start=3D"2460" data-end=3D"2526">
<p data-start=3D"2463" data-end=3D"2526">Cr=C3=A9ez une instance EC2 et ins=
tallez Docker ou Gunicorn + Nginx.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2527" data-end=3D"2571">
<p data-start=3D"2530" data-end=3D"2571">D=C3=A9ployez l=E2=80=99applicatio=
n (via <code data-start=3D"2558" data-end=3D"2568">git pull</code>=E2=80=A6=
).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2572" data-end=3D"2603">
<p data-start=3D"2575" data-end=3D"2603">Base PostgreSQL via <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2595" data-end=3D"2602">RDS</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2604" data-end=3D"2645">
<p data-start=3D"2607" data-end=3D"2645">Configurez Nginx + Certbot pour HT=
TPS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2646" data-end=3D"2694">
<p data-start=3D"2649" data-end=3D"2694">Utilisez IAM, CloudWatch Logs et a=
utoscaling.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2696" data-end=3D"2699">
<h3 data-start=3D"2701" data-end=3D"2746">=E2=9C=85 GCP (Compute Engine / G=
KE / App Engine)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2748" data-end=3D"2886">
<li data-start=3D"2748" data-end=3D"2789">
<p data-start=3D"2750" data-end=3D"2789">GKE : orchestrer les conteneurs Do=
cker.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2790" data-end=3D"2830">
<p data-start=3D"2792" data-end=3D"2830">App Engine : configur=C3=A9 via <c=
ode data-start=3D"2819" data-end=3D"2829">app.yaml</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2831" data-end=3D"2886">
<p data-start=3D"2833" data-end=3D"2886">Compute Engine : VPS classique ave=
c Nginx + Gunicorn.</p>
</li>
</ul>
