=3D"137">Architecture logicielle dans Django</strong>, couvrant :</p>
<hr data-start=3D"151" data-end=3D"154">
<h3 data-start=3D"156" data-end=3D"205">=E2=9C=85 18.4 Django Monolithique =
vs Microservices</h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"206" data-end=3D"262">=F0=9F=A7=A0 18.5 Int=C3=A9gration =
avec GraphQL (Graphene-Django)</h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"263" data-end=3D"329">=F0=9F=A7=BC 18.6 Clean Architectur=
e et s=C3=A9paration des responsabilit=C3=A9s</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"331" data-end=3D"334">
<h2 data-start=3D"336" data-end=3D"382">=E2=9C=85 18.4 Django Monolithique =
vs Microservices</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"384" data-end=3D"387">
<h3 data-start=3D"389" data-end=3D"423">=F0=9F=93=8C Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=
=E2=80=99un monolithe ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"425" data-end=3D"477">Un <strong data-start=3D"428" data-e=
nd=3D"448">monolithe Django</strong> est une application unique :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"478" data-end=3D"639">
<li data-start=3D"478" data-end=3D"578">
<p data-start=3D"480" data-end=3D"578">qui contient toute la logique m=C3=
=A9tier, l=E2=80=99interface web, les API, les mod=C3=A8les et l=E2=80=99au=
thentification,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"579" data-end=3D"639">
<p data-start=3D"581" data-end=3D"639">accessible via un serveur (ou plusie=
urs r=C3=A9pliques) unique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"641" data-end=3D"657">=E2=9C=85 Avantages</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"658" data-end=3D"816">
<li data-start=3D"658" data-end=3D"681">
<p data-start=3D"660" data-end=3D"681">Mise en place rapide,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"682" data-end=3D"729">
<p data-start=3D"684" data-end=3D"729">Simplicit=C3=A9 de d=C3=A9ploiement =
(un seul codebase),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"730" data-end=3D"778">
<p data-start=3D"732" data-end=3D"778">Facilit=C3=A9 de navigation pour une=
 petite =C3=A9quipe,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"779" data-end=3D"816">
<p data-start=3D"781" data-end=3D"816">Django est con=C3=A7u pour le monoli=
the.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"818" data-end=3D"838">=E2=9D=8C Inconv=C3=A9nients</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"839" data-end=3D"1029">
<li data-start=3D"839" data-end=3D"890">
<p data-start=3D"841" data-end=3D"890">Difficult=C3=A9 =C3=A0 faire =C3=A9v=
oluer (trop de d=C3=A9pendances),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"891" data-end=3D"938">
<p data-start=3D"893" data-end=3D"938">Difficile =C3=A0 maintenir avec plus=
ieurs =C3=A9quipes,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"973">
<p data-start=3D"941" data-end=3D"973">Scalabilit=C3=A9 horizontale limit=
=C3=A9e,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"974" data-end=3D"1029">
<p data-start=3D"976" data-end=3D"1029">Une erreur dans une app peut impact=
er tout le projet.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1031" data-end=3D"1034">
<h3 data-start=3D"1036" data-end=3D"1077">=F0=9F=A7=A9 Microservices : une =
autre approche</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1079" data-end=3D"1133">Un <strong data-start=3D"1082" dat=
a-end=3D"1098">microservice</strong> est une <strong data-start=3D"1107" da=
ta-end=3D"1131">application autonome</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1134" data-end=3D"1320">
<li data-start=3D"1134" data-end=3D"1211">
<p data-start=3D"1136" data-end=3D"1211">responsable d=E2=80=99un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1153" data-end=3D"1171">domaine unique</strong> (ex : comptes,=
 commandes, facturation),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1212" data-end=3D"1320">
<p data-start=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1320">communique avec d'autres via des <=
strong data-start=3D"1247" data-end=3D"1259">API REST</strong>, <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1261" data-end=3D"1269">gRPC</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"127=
1" data-end=3D"1282">GraphQL</strong>, ou une <strong data-start=3D"1291" d=
ata-end=3D"1319">queue (RabbitMQ / Kafka)</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1338">=E2=9C=85 Avantages</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"1339" data-end=3D"1496">
<li data-start=3D"1339" data-end=3D"1375">
<p data-start=3D"1341" data-end=3D"1375">Autonomie des =C3=A9quipes par dom=
aine,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1376" data-end=3D"1404">
<p data-start=3D"1378" data-end=3D"1404">D=C3=A9ploiements ind=C3=A9pendant=
s,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1405" data-end=3D"1430">
<p data-start=3D"1407" data-end=3D"1430">=C3=89volutivit=C3=A9 granulaire,<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1431" data-end=3D"1496">
<p data-start=3D"1433" data-end=3D"1496">Meilleure r=C3=A9silience (un serv=
ice peut tomber sans tout casser).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"1498" data-end=3D"1518">=E2=9D=8C Inconv=C3=A9nients</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"1519" data-end=3D"1691">
<li data-start=3D"1519" data-end=3D"1573">
<p data-start=3D"1521" data-end=3D"1573">Complexit=C3=A9 op=C3=A9rationnell=
e (CI/CD, monitoring, etc.),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1574" data-end=3D"1608">
<p data-start=3D"1576" data-end=3D"1608">Multiplication des d=C3=A9ploiemen=
ts,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1609" data-end=3D"1643">
<p data-start=3D"1611" data-end=3D"1643">Tests d=E2=80=99int=C3=A9gration p=
lus lourds,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1644" data-end=3D"1691">
<p data-start=3D"1646" data-end=3D"1691">Plus difficile =C3=A0 mettre en pl=
ace sans DevOps.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1693" data-end=3D"1696">
<h3 data-start=3D"1698" data-end=3D"1747">=F0=9F=A7=AA Django dans une arch=
itecture microservices</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1749" data-end=3D"1808">Django peut =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9=
 dans un syst=C3=A8me de microservices :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1809" data-end=3D"2080">
<li data-start=3D"1809" data-end=3D"1876">
<p data-start=3D"1811" data-end=3D"1876">Chaque microservice peut =C3=AAtre=
 un projet Django REST API autonome,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1877" data-end=3D"2007">
<p data-start=3D"1879" data-end=3D"2007">Les services communiquent via <str=
ong data-start=3D"1909" data-end=3D"1921">REST API</strong>, <strong data-s=
